The firm is headquartered in Victoria with offices in Vancouver, Duncan, Campbell River and Kelowna, and says it serves clients from around the world with legal issues in British Columbia. It cites more than 160 years of experience across its areas of law. Its pages cover car accident claims, estate planning and disputes, including who can dispute a will in BC, and marine matters such as boating accidents, seized boats and anchoring or mooring concerns.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('jarrah-law-edmonton','Jarrah Law','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.8,183,53.5422014,-113.4995537,'{"name":"Jarrah Law","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.5422014,"lng":-113.4995537,"address":"10154 104 Street NW #402, Edmonton, AB T5J 1A7","phone":"+17806654955","rating":4.8,"count":183,"slug":"jarrah-law-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Jarrah+Law+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10154+104+Street+NW+%23402%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5J+1A7","website":"https://jarrahlaw.com","blurb":"Family Law in Edmonton. Rated 4.8 from 183 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/jarrah-law-edmonton.jpg"}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]],"7":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Jarrah Law is an Edmonton firm handling family law and criminal defence for Albertans.

The family law side covers parenting and access disputes, child and spousal support, and division of family property. Criminal defence covers assaults, firearm and weapon offences, theft and break and enter, impaired driving, drug charges, and advice on police interviews. The lawyer writes in the first person, offers up to one hour of initial legal advice, and describes a paperless process with digital signatures and different options for hiring. The site stresses familiarity with court procedures, timelines and tactics.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('hepburn-criminal-law-hamilton','Hepburn Criminal Law','Hamilton','ON','hamilton-niagara',0,4.9,178,43.2553276,-79.8684899,'{"name":"Hepburn Criminal Law","city":"Hamilton","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Employment Law","Wills & Estates","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["criminal","employment","wills","litigation"],"region":"hamilton-niagara","province":"ON","lat":43.2553276,"lng":-79.8684899,"address":"UNION GAS BUILDING, 20 Hughson St S, Hamilton, ON L8N 2A1","phone":"+19058695488","rating":4.9,"count":178,"slug":"hepburn-criminal-law-hamilton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Hepburn+Criminal+Law+Hamilton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=UNION+GAS+BUILDING%2C+20+Hughson+St+S%2C+Hamilton%2C+ON+L8N+2A1","website":"https://criminaldefencelawyerontario.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Employment Law in Hamilton. Rated 4.9 from 178 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/hepburn-criminal-law-hamilton.png"}',NULL,'Hepburn Criminal Law is a Hamilton boutique firm handling criminal defence matters, including domestic assault charges.

Kaley Hepburn has practised since 2010 and says she has advocated for clients for fifteen years in courtrooms in Hamilton and throughout the Golden Horseshoe. She previously worked at one of Hamilton''s largest criminal defence firms, was featured in a 2012 Hamilton Spectator article on young professionals, and works with Sabrin Abbas. The firm says it aims to give individual attention and clarity during a stressful process. Its domestic assault page explains how such charges are approached and defended.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('sitka-law-group-victoria','Sitka Law Group','Victoria','BC','bc-victoria',0,4.8,180,48.46132,-123.333078,'{"name":"Sitka Law Group","city":"Victoria","featured":false,"tags":[],"caseTypes":[],"region":"bc-victoria","province":"BC","lat":48.46132,"lng":-123.333078,"address":"3750 Shelbourne St #202, Victoria, BC V8P 4H4","phone":"+17782652677","rating":4.8,"count":180,"slug":"sitka-law-group-victoria","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sitka+Law+Group+Victoria+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=3750+Shelbourne+St+%23202%2C+Victoria%2C+BC+V8P+4H4","website":"https://sitkalaw.ca","blurb":"Law firm in Victoria. Rated 4.8 from 180 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/sitka-law-group-victoria.png"}',NULL,'Sitka Law Group is a Victoria, BC firm of lawyers and notaries handling real estate, estate planning, estate administration, business law and civil litigation.

