The firm is led by founding partner Weston Powell and says it focuses exclusively on courtroom advocacy and dispute resolution rather than general practice. It lists commercial conflicts, real estate disputes and estate challenges, and says it appears in the Ontario Superior Court of Justice for clients across Southern Ontario. Its office is in Toronto, and structured data also names Richmond Hill among the places served, and the site states over 40 years of combined trial experience.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('property-law-firm-cb-llp-calgary','Property Law Firm CB LLP','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,1250,51.1290181,-114.20437,'{"name":"Property Law Firm CB LLP","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.1290181,"lng":-114.20437,"address":"600 Crowfoot Crescent NW #240, Calgary, AB T3G 0B4","phone":"+14038008000","rating":4.9,"count":1250,"slug":"property-law-firm-cb-llp-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Property+Law+Firm+CB+LLP+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=600+Crowfoot+Crescent+NW+%23240%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T3G+0B4","website":"https://www.propertylaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 1250 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/property-law-firm-cb-llp-calgary.webp"}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]],"7":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Property Law Firm CB LLP is a Calgary real estate practice handling home purchases, sales, refinancing and ownership transfers.

The firm describes itself as a purpose-built real estate firm serving clients across Canada, with offices in Alberta and Ontario. It says it guides people from home purchases through to complex lending agreements, using remote closings and digital documentation to limit delays. Its website names realtors, lenders and title companies as the professionals it works with, and states a focus on heading off legal issues before a closing. Its mission page speaks of changing how real estate is transacted nationally.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('clark-and-clark-lawyers-calgary','Clark & Clark Lawyers','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,535,50.999298,-114.0661544,'{"name":"Clark & Clark Lawyers","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":50.999298,"lng":-114.0661544,"address":"6020 1a St SW Ste 8, Calgary, AB T2H 0G3","phone":"+14037771444","rating":4.9,"count":535,"slug":"clark-and-clark-lawyers-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Clark+%26+Clark+Lawyers+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=6020+1a+St+SW+Ste+8%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2H+0G3","website":"https://clarklegal.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 535 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/clark-and-clark-lawyers-calgary.png"}',NULL,'Clark & Clark Lawyers is a Calgary firm handling residential and commercial real estate, corporate and commercial law, and wills and estates.

The site says the firm has served the Calgary community since 1995 and calls residential real estate the core of its practice, whether the property is a condominium or a quarter section. Its real estate services include buying, selling and refinancing, preparing leases, and conveyancing for residential development projects, from subdividing a lot to a hundred-unit condominium. Corporate work covers incorporation, partnerships and joint ventures, and estate work covers wills, powers of attorney and personal directives. Clients anywhere in Alberta can sign remotely.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('summit-legal-group-calgary','Summit Legal Group','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,594,50.9874687,-114.028594,'{"name":"Summit Legal Group","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":50.9874687,"lng":-114.028594,"address":"30 Glendeer Cir SE #200, Calgary, AB T2H 2Z7","phone":"+15873560356","rating":4.9,"count":594,"slug":"summit-legal-group-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Summit+Legal+Group+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=30+Glendeer+Cir+SE+%23200%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2H+2Z7","website":"https://www.summitlegalgroup.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 594 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/summit-legal-group-calgary.webp"}',NULL,'Summit Legal Group is a boutique Calgary firm covering real estate, wills and estates, business law, domestic contracts and notary services.

On real estate, the firm says it acts for buyers and sellers of residential and commercial properties, preparing and registering the necessary documents. Its estate work includes wills and estate planning, probate, administration of estates and trusts, executor advisor services and dependent adult matters. The notary page lists notarizing documents, administering oaths and affirmations and certifying true copies, and explains that a notary verifies identity and voluntary signing to deter fraud.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('shivji-law-calgary','Shivji Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,316,51.0004539,-114.0701217,'{"name":"Shivji Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0004539,"lng":-114.0701217,"address":"5940 Macleod Trl SW #601, Calgary, AB T2H 2G4","phone":"+14032535588","rating":4.9,"count":316,"slug":"shivji-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Shivji+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=5940+Macleod+Trl+SW+%23601%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2H+2G4","website":"https://shivjilaw.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 316 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/shivji-law-calgary.webp"}',NULL,'Shivji Law is a boutique Calgary firm focused on residential real estate, with wills and estates and employment law as additional services.

Its real estate pages cover purchases, including new condominiums, foreclosure properties and houses bought from builders, as well as sales, refinancing and construction draw mortgages. The site names Farouk Shivji, Madisyn Gilbert, Abi Poxon and Mizghan Darwishan on its team. The office sits just outside the downtown core, with parking for clients and access from all quadrants of the city, and the website also carries local market news, including Calgary planning decisions.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('passgo-real-estate-law-calgary','PassGo Real Estate Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.9,403,50.9085299,-114.063414,'{"name":"PassGo Real Estate Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":50.9085299,"lng":-114.063414,"address":"340 Midpark Way SE Ste 203, Calgary, AB T2X 1P1","phone":"+15875707427","rating":4.9,"count":403,"slug":"passgo-real-estate-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/PassGo+Real+Estate+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=340+Midpark+Way+SE+Ste+203%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2X+1P1","website":"https://passgo.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Calgary. Rated 4.9 from 403 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/passgo-real-estate-law-calgary.png"}',NULL,'PassGo Real Estate Law is a Calgary firm that closes home purchases, sales, mortgage refinances and title transfers through an online workspace or in person.

According to its website, the firm acts on properties in Alberta and British Columbia. Clients upload documents, meet with a lawyer online or face to face, and then collect keys or receive funds. For title changes, it says it prepares the transfer, coordinates mortgage requirements and files with Alberta Land Titles. The team page names Erin Crocker, who reports over ten years of practice, along with Shivam Parekh, Amy Kim, Cari Henschel, Denyse Giguere, Anthony Staddon, Emily Johnston and Kaiya Proulx.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('pringle-law-edmonton','Pringle Law','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.9,541,53.542498,-113.4908164,'{"name":"Pringle Law","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["criminal","litigation"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.542498,"lng":-113.4908164,"address":"10150 100 St NW #300, Edmonton, AB T5J 0N8","phone":"+17804248866","rating":4.9,"count":541,"slug":"pringle-law-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Pringle+Law+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10150+100+St+NW+%23300%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5J+0N8","website":"https://www.pringlelaw.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Civil Litigation in Edmonton. Rated 4.9 from 541 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/pringle-law-edmonton.webp"}',NULL,'Pringle Law is an Edmonton criminal defence firm representing people charged with criminal and regulatory offences across Western Canada.

The firm says criminal defence is the only area every one of its lawyers practises. Offences it lists range from driving offences and domestic violence to sexual offences and weapons offences, and it describes handling every stage from arrest and bail hearings to sentencing, trials and appeals. The firm also takes administrative offences, and its structured data adds British Columbia and the Northwest Territories to the service area. The lawyers page names Dan Chivers, Michael D. Sparks and the late Alexander Pringle, K.C. (1947-2015), and the site includes an extradition guide and an articling student program.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('james-h-brown-and-associates-edmonton','James H. Brown & Associates','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.9,1701,53.542172,-113.4879108,'{"name":"James H. Brown & Associates","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["injury","litigation"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.542172,"lng":-113.4879108,"address":"10123 99 St NW, Edmonton, AB T5J 3H1","phone":"+17804280088","rating":4.9,"count":1701,"slug":"james-h-brown-and-associates-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/James+H.+Brown+%26+Associates+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10123+99+St+NW%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5J+3H1","website":"https://www.jameshbrown.com","blurb":"Personal Injury / Civil Litigation in Edmonton. Rated 4.9 from 1701 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/james-h-brown-and-associates-edmonton.webp"}',NULL,'James H Brown & Associates is an Edmonton personal injury firm acting for Albertans hurt in car accidents and other serious accidents.

The site says the firm was formed by James H. Brown, who at 19 suffered a broken neck in a head-on collision with a drunk driver, ending his professional hockey career. Injury types it describes include spinal cord injury, traumatic brain injury, whiplash and wrongful death, and it cites over 200 years of combined experience among its lawyers. The firm says its aim is to help injured people recover compensation for medical expenses, lost wages and other damages, and it describes itself as handling precedent-setting car accident cases.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('snowdrop-immigration-services-ltd-edmonton','Snowdrop Immigration Services Ltd','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.9,1231,53.4167306,-113.4782628,'{"name":"Snowdrop Immigration Services Ltd","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.4167306,"lng":-113.4782628,"address":"1803 91 St SW unit#105, Edmonton, AB T6X 0C8","phone":"+15874161702","rating":4.9,"count":1231,"slug":"snowdrop-immigration-services-ltd-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Snowdrop+Immigration+Services+Ltd+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1803+91+St+SW+unit%23105%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T6X+0C8","website":"https://snowdropimmigration.ca","blurb":"Immigration in Edmonton. Rated 4.9 from 1231 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/snowdrop-immigration-services-ltd-edmonton.png"}',NULL,'Snowdrop Immigration Services Ltd is an Edmonton firm offering permanent residence, study permit, work permit and visitor visa services.

The firm describes itself as registered and regulated and says it works only on Canadian immigration. Its services page lists Express Entry, family sponsorship, provincial nominee applications, the Rural and Northern Immigration Pilot, the Atlantic Immigration Pilot, work permits and work permit extensions, as well as super visa support. The site says its team studies each client''s background and eligibility before planning a pathway, and it includes a message from the director.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('preferred-immigration-services-edmonton','Preferred Immigration Services','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.9,412,53.5462739,-113.6264647,'{"name":"Preferred Immigration Services","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.5462739,"lng":-113.6264647,"address":"10335 178 St NW #204, Edmonton, AB T5S 1G4","phone":"+17804307987","rating":4.9,"count":412,"slug":"preferred-immigration-services-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Preferred+Immigration+Services+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10335+178+St+NW+%23204%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5S+1G4","website":"https://www.preferredimmigration.com","blurb":"Immigration in Edmonton. Rated 4.9 from 412 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/preferred-immigration-services-edmonton.png"}',NULL,'Preferred Immigration Services is an Edmonton immigration consulting practice assisting with work permits, Express Entry, LMIA and sponsorship.

It also covers permanent residence. Carl Wurfel is named as director, and the site says its consultants have worked in the field for over ten years. The firm lists study permits and spousal sponsorship among its services and says it acts for individuals, families and employers. It states that it serves Edmonton, Sherwood Park, St. Albert, Spruce Grove, Stony Plain, Leduc and surrounding Alberta communities, and it says many clients come through referrals from friends and family.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('olalere-law-office-ottawa','Olalere Law Office','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.9,319,45.4099895,-75.6983358,'{"name":"Olalere Law Office","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4099895,"lng":-75.6983358,"address":"508 Gladstone Ave Ste 206, Ottawa, ON K1R 5P1","phone":"+16139618406","rating":4.9,"count":319,"slug":"olalere-law-office-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Olalere+Law+Office+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=508+Gladstone+Ave+Ste+206%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1R+5P1","website":"https://www.ottawaimmigrationlawyers.com","blurb":"Immigration in Ottawa. Rated 4.9 from 319 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/olalere-law-office-ottawa.png"}','{"1":[["10:00","18:00"]],"2":[["10:00","18:00"]],"3":[["10:00","18:00"]],"4":[["10:00","18:00"]],"5":[["10:00","18:00"]]}','Olalere Law Office is an Ottawa immigration firm concentrating on appeals of refused applications and removal orders.

Those appeals go before the Immigration and Refugee Board and the Federal Court. The site says the practice dates to 2004 and is led by twin brothers Kehinde and Taiwo Olalere, who both studied law and political science at Carleton University. It explains appeal routes such as the Immigration Appeal Division for refused sponsorships and the Refugee Appeal Division for negative refugee decisions. As a full-service firm it also handles family sponsorship, Express Entry, study and work permits, visitor visas, citizenship, humanitarian and compassionate applications and inadmissibility, and publishes selected decisions.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('jsm-law-mississauga','JSM Law','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,4.9,564,43.6637916,-79.6561279,'{"name":"JSM Law","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6637916,"lng":-79.6561279,"address":"6375 Dixie Rd Ste 201, Mississauga, ON L5T 2E7","phone":"+19054999896","rating":4.9,"count":564,"slug":"jsm-law-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/JSM+Law+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=6375+Dixie+Rd+Ste+201%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5T+2E7","website":"https://www.jsmlaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Mississauga. Rated 4.9 from 564 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/jsm-law-mississauga.png"}',NULL,'JSM Law is a Mississauga firm offering civil litigation, personal injury, real estate, corporate, condominium, criminal and wills and estates services.

Its website says it acts for clients across Mississauga, Brampton, Oakville, Hamilton, Milton, Burlington, Vaughan, Markham and Scarborough. A condominium law page explains that condominium corporations exist under the Condominium Act, 1998 and describes advice on both day-to-day matters and contract arrangements. The firm says it works on contingency fee structures and that its civil litigation lawyers understand the strategies insurance companies use in injury matters.','dynamic','live',NULL);
