According to its website, the firm has offices in 15 locations across Canada. Its listed practice areas also include civil litigation, such as contract disputes, debt collection, property disputes and tort claims, along with immigration law, business law, real estate law, and wills and estate planning. The site says its class action litigation has secured financial compensation for thousands of Canadians, and it describes a team of corporate lawyers for business clients.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('mawazini-visa-and-immigration-services-ottawa','Mawazini Visa & immigration Services','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.9,143,45.2748905,-75.7057172,'{"name":"Mawazini Visa & immigration Services","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.2748905,"lng":-75.7057172,"address":"11 Grandlea Terrace, Nepean, ON K2G 6X6","phone":"+16139790979","rating":4.9,"count":143,"slug":"mawazini-visa-and-immigration-services-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Mawazini+Visa+%26+immigration+Services+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=11+Grandlea+Terrace%2C+Nepean%2C+ON+K2G+6X6","website":"https://www.mawazini.ca","blurb":"Immigration in Ottawa. Rated 4.9 from 143 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/mawazini-visa-and-immigration-services-ottawa.webp"}',NULL,'Mawazini Visa and Immigration Services is an Ottawa consultancy assisting with refugee protection, family sponsorship, study and work permits and appeals.

The site describes it as an immigration consulting firm led by Abdullah Mawazini, a licensed consultant accredited by the Canadian College of Immigration and Citizenship Consultants, and says it has over 22 years of experience and hundreds of completed cases. Services listed include refugee applications and hearings, appeals of refused applications, sponsorship of spouses, parents and children, passport services, permanent residence, PR cards, visit applications, academic accreditation reports, and RCMP fingerprints and biometrics. The address given is in Nepean.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('laws-and-beyond-calgary','Laws & Beyond','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.8,143,51.048038,-114.0759336,'{"name":"Laws & Beyond","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Civil Litigation","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["family","litigation","wills"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.048038,"lng":-114.0759336,"address":"634 6 Ave SW Ste 320, Calgary, AB T2P 2Y5","phone":"+14033005297","rating":4.8,"count":143,"slug":"laws-and-beyond-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Laws+%26+Beyond+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=634+6+Ave+SW+Ste+320%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2P+2Y5","website":"https://lawsnbeyond.com","blurb":"Family Law / Civil Litigation in Calgary. Rated 4.8 from 143 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/laws-and-beyond-calgary.webp"}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]],"7":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Laws & Beyond is a Calgary firm handling family law, civil litigation, wills and estates, real estate and employment matters.

On family matters its site lists separation, divorce, emergency protection orders, spousal and child support, parenting arrangements, marital agreements and family violence, noting that Alberta now frames custody as decision-making responsibility and parenting time. The firm says it uses negotiation, mediation and other alternative dispute resolution where feasible but is prepared to go to court when required. It also lists notarization and commissioning services and describes its approach as tailored to each client''s goals and circumstances.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('pacific-point-law-corporation-surrey','Pacific Point Law Corporation','Surrey','BC','bc-fraser',0,4.9,139,49.0463869,-122.7905064,'{"name":"Pacific Point Law Corporation","city":"Surrey","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Immigration","Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["family","immigration","realestate"],"region":"bc-fraser","province":"BC","lat":49.0463869,"lng":-122.7905064,"address":"15585 24 Ave Unit 107, Surrey, BC V4A 2J4","phone":"+16047388837","rating":4.9,"count":139,"slug":"pacific-point-law-corporation-surrey","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Pacific+Point+Law+Corporation+Surrey+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=15585+24+Ave+Unit+107%2C+Surrey%2C+BC+V4A+2J4","website":"https://www.pacificpointlaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law / Immigration in Surrey. Rated 4.9 from 139 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/pacific-point-law-corporation-surrey.webp"}','{"1":[["10:00","19:00"]],"2":[["10:00","19:00"]],"3":[["10:00","19:00"]],"4":[["10:00","19:00"]],"5":[["10:00","19:00"]]}','Pacific Point Law Corporation is a Surrey firm covering family law, immigration and refugee matters, real estate, wills and estates, and business law.

Its site lists further areas including corporate services, intellectual property, civil disputes and criminal defence, and says it serves Surrey, White Rock, Delta, Langley, Cloverdale and Metro Vancouver. The office sits minutes from the Peace Arch border crossing, stays open until 7 PM on weekdays, and offers appointments in English, Hindi, Urdu, Punjabi and ASL. A second office in Kelowna operates by appointment, and the firm notes a successful PRRA decision for a client facing removal.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('rpb-family-law-ottawa','RPB Family Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.9,137,45.3928326,-75.7546329,'{"name":"RPB Family Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.3928326,"lng":-75.7546329,"address":"376 Churchill Ave N Ste 302, Ottawa, ON K1Z 5C3","phone":"+16132165044","rating":4.9,"count":137,"slug":"rpb-family-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/RPB+Family+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=376+Churchill+Ave+N+Ste+302%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1Z+5C3","website":"https://rpblaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Ottawa. Rated 4.9 from 137 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/rpb-family-law-ottawa.webp"}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','RPB Family Law is an Ottawa firm focused on family matters such as divorce, child custody, spousal support and property division.

The firm says it uses technology and cloud services to keep files moving and clients informed. Its pages describe separation agreements, adoption, domestic violence and parenting issues, handled through negotiation, settlement agreements and litigation, for families in Ottawa and Eastern Ontario. The team page names Ronan Blake, Gisele Alexander, Maria Ilie-Draga, Michael Randazzo and Jeremiah Kalyniak, and the office is on Churchill Avenue North.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('kn-law-toronto','KN LAW','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.9,135,43.8087363,-79.2430885,'{"name":"KN LAW","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.8087363,"lng":-79.2430885,"address":"2225 Markham Rd Ste 303, Scarborough, ON M1B 2W4","phone":"+16473501250","rating":4.9,"count":135,"slug":"kn-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/KN+LAW+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2225+Markham+Rd+Ste+303%2C+Scarborough%2C+ON+M1B+2W4","website":"https://www.knlegalservices.com","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Toronto. Rated 4.9 from 135 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/kn-law-toronto.png"}','{"1":[["09:00","18:00"]],"2":[["09:00","18:00"]],"3":[["09:00","18:00"]],"4":[["09:00","18:00"]],"5":[["09:00","18:00"]]}','KN LAW is a Toronto-area virtual law practice closing Ontario real estate deals, including purchases, sales, refinances and title transfers.

KN LAW Professional Corporation says it was built as a fully virtual practice, with signing done from home, so it can serve clients from Thunder Bay to Windsor and Ottawa to Niagara Falls. Its services also include survivorship applications after a joint tenant dies, private mortgage transactions for borrowers and lenders, and reverse mortgage registrations for homeowners aged 55 and over. The firm limits its work to Ontario real estate law and says clients receive a breakdown of fees and disbursements before signing.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('hsp-law-north-york','HSP Law','North York','ON','toronto',0,5,130,43.7260134,-79.3492236,'{"name":"HSP Law","city":"North York","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7260134,"lng":-79.3492236,"address":"1131A Leslie St Ste 201, North York, ON M3C 3L8","phone":"+16478833533","rating":5,"count":130,"slug":"hsp-law-north-york","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/HSP+Law+North+York+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1131A+Leslie+St+Ste+201%2C+North+York%2C+ON+M3C+3L8","website":"https://www.hsplaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in North York. Rated 5.0 from 130 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/hsp-law-north-york.png"}','{"1":[["08:00","17:00"]],"2":[["08:00","17:00"]],"3":[["08:00","17:00"]],"4":[["08:00","17:00"]],"5":[["08:00","17:00"]]}','HSP Law is a North York personal injury firm handling car accidents, slip and falls, dog bites and long-term disability matters.

The firm says it has acted for injured people for over 40 years and lists offices in Whitby, Oshawa, Toronto, Niagara Falls and Calgary. Its pages also cover ATV and snowmobile accidents and cases involving the death of a loved one through negligence. Harlan A. Pottins is named on the about page. HSP Law states that clients pay no upfront legal fees or costs, with payment due only on a successful outcome.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('gerami-law-pc-ottawa','Gerami Law PC','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.6,140,45.4211161,-75.697111,'{"name":"Gerami Law PC","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4211161,"lng":-75.697111,"address":"130 Albert St #2010, Ottawa, ON K1P 1B1","phone":"+16137010532","rating":4.6,"count":140,"slug":"gerami-law-pc-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Gerami+Law+PC+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=130+Albert+St+%232010%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1P+1B1","website":"https://www.geramilaw.com","blurb":"Immigration in Ottawa. Rated 4.6 from 140 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/gerami-law-pc-ottawa.png"}',NULL,'Gerami Law PC is an Ottawa immigration firm handling refugee protection, family sponsorship, study and visitor permits and citizenship applications.

Operating since 2011, the firm has its headquarters in Ottawa and remote offices in Toronto and Vancouver. Founder Arghavan Gerami has practised in Ontario for over 15 years, and the team page also names Elham Tarahimofrad, Ana Paula Aguilar Gomez and Nathan Knoble Kenna. Its refugee work covers application forms, narratives, hearing preparation and submissions before the Board, while an urgent practice group deals with removals, admissibility hearings and pre-removal risk assessments.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('leiter-rahme-attorneys-inc-montreal','Leiter Rahme Attorneys Inc.','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.9,129,45.5173037,-73.5901104,'{"name":"Leiter Rahme Attorneys Inc.","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.5173037,"lng":-73.5901104,"address":"4541 Av. du Parc, Montréal, QC H2V 4E4","phone":"+15143952010","rating":4.9,"count":129,"slug":"leiter-rahme-attorneys-inc-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Leiter+Rahme+Attorneys+Inc.+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4541+Av.+du+Parc%2C+Montr%C3%A9al%2C+QC+H2V+4E4","website":"https://immcanada.com","blurb":"Immigration in Montreal. Rated 4.9 from 129 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/leiter-rahme-attorneys-inc-montreal.png"}',NULL,'Leiter Rahme Attorneys is a Montreal firm handling Canadian and American immigration law for clients around the world.

The firm describes its head office in Montreal and additional offices in the Middle East and the Gulf. Its site lists clients from dozens of countries, among them China, Iran, Lebanon, France, Mexico, India, Nigeria, Brazil and the Philippines. The lawyers say they can serve clients in English, French, Mandarin, Spanish, Arabic, Portuguese, Romanian, Italian and Hebrew, and the site explains why applicants may want an immigration lawyer for temporary or permanent visa applications and for challenging decisions by immigration authorities.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('ld-law-llp-toronto','LD Law LLP','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.8,131,43.6559562,-79.4533078,'{"name":"LD Law LLP","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6559562,"lng":-79.4533078,"address":"1551 Bloor St W, Toronto, ON M6P 1A5","phone":"+14167479900","rating":4.8,"count":131,"slug":"ld-law-llp-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/LD+Law+LLP+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1551+Bloor+St+W%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M6P+1A5","website":"https://www.ldlaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Toronto. Rated 4.8 from 131 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/ld-law-llp-toronto.webp"}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','LD Law LLP is a Toronto firm handling real estate closings, mortgage refinances, title issues and title insurance across Ontario.

The site says the firm acts for buyers, sellers and owners of residential and commercial property, and also takes on real estate litigation. It lists wills and estate planning, family law and business law as further practice areas, and mentions employment, corporate and commercial matters. David Baptista dos Reis and Daniel La Gamba are the lawyers named, and a separate page addresses real estate services in Brantford.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('bernard-lau-and-co-law-office-richmond','Bernard Lau and Co. Law Office','Richmond','BC','bc-richmond',0,4.9,128,49.1666824,-123.135496,'{"name":"Bernard Lau and Co. Law Office","city":"Richmond","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"bc-richmond","province":"BC","lat":49.1666824,"lng":-123.135496,"address":"6388 Number 3 Rd #930, Richmond, BC V6Y 0L4","phone":"+16042855240","rating":4.9,"count":128,"slug":"bernard-lau-and-co-law-office-richmond","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Bernard+Lau+and+Co.+Law+Office+Richmond+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=6388+Number+3+Rd+%23930%2C+Richmond%2C+BC+V6Y+0L4","website":"https://www.bernardlau.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Richmond. Rated 4.9 from 128 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/bernard-lau-and-co-law-office-richmond.png"}',NULL,'Based in Richmond, BC, this boutique firm led by Bernard Lau handles real estate conveyancing, civil litigation, builder''s liens and wills and estates.

The firm, Bernard Lau and Co. Law Office, also lists defamation and notarization work and serves Richmond and Metro Vancouver. Its team is fluent in English, Mandarin and Cantonese, and the site notes a network of legal professionals overseas that supports out-of-town signings in China, Hong Kong and the wider Asia-Pacific region. It says it works with the major chartered banks on mortgages and helps with closing disputes such as home deficiencies, oil tank discoveries and collapsing deals.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('merovitz-potechin-llp-ottawa','Merovitz Potechin LLP','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.7,133,45.3816716,-75.7452423,'{"name":"Merovitz Potechin LLP","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.3816716,"lng":-75.7452423,"address":"1565 Carling Ave #300, Ottawa, ON K1Z 8P9","phone":"+16135637544","rating":4.7,"count":133,"slug":"merovitz-potechin-llp-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Merovitz+Potechin+LLP+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1565+Carling+Ave+%23300%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1Z+8P9","website":"https://www.merovitzpotechin.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Ottawa. Rated 4.7 from 133 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/merovitz-potechin-llp-ottawa.png"}',NULL,'Merovitz Potechin LLP is an Ottawa firm serving personal and business clients in litigation, business law, real estate, and wills and estates.

Chuck Merovitz started the firm in April 1976 and Bram Potechin joined as a partner in 1978. The site marks a 50th anniversary in 2026 and says the firm had grown to 19 lawyers and over 40 support staff by 2025. Its history names Robert De Toni, Timothy Grieve, Eli Udell, Yasmin Vinograd and Mitchell Besner as later additions, and it describes community support for causes such as CHEO and the Ottawa Regional Cancer Foundation.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('droit-ouimet-mcpherson-law-ottawa','Droit Ouimet-McPherson Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,5,125,45.4426077,-75.6409421,'{"name":"Droit Ouimet-McPherson Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4426077,"lng":-75.6409421,"address":"608 Cummings Ave., Ottawa, ON K1K 2K6","phone":"+13438888913","rating":5,"count":125,"slug":"droit-ouimet-mcpherson-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Droit+Ouimet-McPherson+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=608+Cummings+Ave.%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1K+2K6","website":"https://ottawa.law","blurb":"Real Estate in Ottawa. Rated 5.0 from 125 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/droit-ouimet-mcpherson-law-ottawa.png"}',NULL,'Droit Ouimet-McPherson Law is an Ottawa boutique firm offering real estate, business law, estate planning and estate administration in English and French.

Its owner, Marc, was raised in Ottawa, holds an LL.B. from the University of Ottawa''s French common law program and founded the firm in 2020 after practising in Orléans and Rockland. The site says the firm limits itself to no more than 25 transactions a month, uses secure online forms alongside virtual and in-person meetings, and prepares documents for probate applications. It also offers executor services at 4.0 percent of the estate value, subject to a minimum.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('travers-law-guelph','Travers Law','Guelph','ON','waterloo-guelph',0,4.7,132,43.5405966,-80.2431314,'{"name":"Travers Law","city":"Guelph","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates","Business Law"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills","business"],"region":"waterloo-guelph","province":"ON","lat":43.5405966,"lng":-80.2431314,"address":"100 Gordon St, Guelph, ON N1H 4H6","phone":"+18777442281","rating":4.7,"count":132,"slug":"travers-law-guelph","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Travers+Law+Guelph+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=100+Gordon+St%2C+Guelph%2C+ON+N1H+4H6","website":"https://www.traverslaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Guelph. Rated 4.7 from 132 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/travers-law-guelph.webp"}',NULL,'Travers Law is a Guelph firm with a high-volume real estate, wills and estates, and business law practice across four Ontario offices.

The offices are in Kitchener-Waterloo, Cambridge, Guelph and Milton. Don Travers, called to the bar in 1974, founded the firm in 1981 under the name Paquette Travers and served on Kitchener council and Waterloo Regional Council. The site says the firm has worked in real estate law for over 40 years, offers evening appointments, remote and virtual meetings and fixed fees, and serves Waterloo, Kitchener, Cambridge, Fergus, Elora, Puslinch and Wellington County. Bryan Mayes and Robert A. Sheldon are also named, and family law is mentioned as a secondary area.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('capelle-kane-immigration-lawyers-ottawa','Capelle Kane Immigration Lawyers','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,5,123,45.3900137,-75.7533169,'{"name":"Capelle Kane Immigration Lawyers","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.3900137,"lng":-75.7533169,"address":"360 Ravenhill Ave E, Ottawa, ON K2A 1S5","phone":"+16132307070","rating":5,"count":123,"slug":"capelle-kane-immigration-lawyers-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Capelle+Kane+Immigration+Lawyers+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=360+Ravenhill+Ave+E%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K2A+1S5","website":"https://www.capellekane.com","blurb":"Immigration in Ottawa. Rated 5.0 from 123 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/capelle-kane-immigration-lawyers-ottawa.png"}',NULL,'Capelle Kane Immigration Lawyers is an Ottawa firm advising on Canadian citizenship and immigration, with corporate immigration work for employers.

The firm says it has given legal advice on these laws since 1994 and that two of its lawyers hold Law Society of Ontario certification in citizenship and immigration law, which it describes as unique among Ottawa firms. Its work covers bringing international talent to Canada for Canadian and multinational companies, reuniting families, and reducing delays in visa processing. Betsy Kane, a founding partner, began her career with Citizenship and Immigration Canada at national headquarters in Ottawa.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('s-zalman-haouzi-avocat-montreal','S. Zalman Haouzi Avocat','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.9,125,45.5061509,-73.5559527,'{"name":"S. Zalman Haouzi Avocat","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.5061509,"lng":-73.5559527,"address":"510 Boul. Saint-Laurent #400, Montreal, Quebec H2Y 2Y9","phone":"+15145624236","rating":4.9,"count":125,"slug":"s-zalman-haouzi-avocat-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/S.+Zalman+Haouzi+Avocat+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=510+Boul.+Saint-Laurent+%23400%2C+Montreal%2C+Quebec+H2Y+2Y9","website":"https://www.solutionlegale.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Montreal. Rated 4.9 from 125 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/s-zalman-haouzi-avocat-montreal.png"}',NULL,'Zalman Haouzi Avocat is a Montreal boutique handling criminal defence for clients in Longueuil, Laval, Valleyfield and surrounding areas.

Founded in 2011, the practice says it treats a criminal charge as a problem to be solved and works with first-time offenders to avoid a criminal record. It describes assistance from the first interaction with police through to resolution of the file, and a preference for negotiated outcomes over trial where possible. Zalman Haouzi, who has practised in Montreal for more than a decade, is named as the lawyer behind the firm, and the site frames the work as minimizing the consequences of an accusation.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('hughes-law-corporation-vancouver','Hughes Law Corporation','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.8,127,49.2636797,-123.1212853,'{"name":"Hughes Law Corporation","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2636797,"lng":-123.1212853,"address":"777 W Broadway Ste 208, Vancouver, BC V5Z 4J7","phone":"+16046021828","rating":4.8,"count":127,"slug":"hughes-law-corporation-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Hughes+Law+Corporation+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=777+W+Broadway+Ste+208%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V5Z+4J7","website":"https://www.hughesco.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Vancouver. Rated 4.8 from 127 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/hughes-law-corporation-vancouver.png"}',NULL,'Hughes Law Corporation is a Vancouver firm handling residential and commercial real estate conveyancing, mortgage refinancing and landlord and tenant disputes.

The firm says it has been in business for close to 30 years. Its other areas include wills and estates and business acquisitions and sales. Principal lawyer Cedric Hughes is a University of British Columbia graduate and a member of the Law Society of British Columbia. The site notes that many clients live outside Vancouver, and that meeting offices around the Lower Mainland, including North Vancouver and Surrey/Delta, allow the lawyers to come to the client.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('watchmaker-law-car-accident-and-personal-injury-lawyers-edmonton','Watchmaker Law Car Accident and Personal Injury Lawyers','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,5,121,53.5439131,-113.5118675,'{"name":"Watchmaker Law Car Accident and Personal Injury Lawyers","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["injury","litigation"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.5439131,"lng":-113.5118675,"address":"10235 111 St NW Unit 6, Edmonton, AB T5K 2V5","phone":"+15878502899","rating":5,"count":121,"slug":"watchmaker-law-car-accident-and-personal-injury-lawyers-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Watchmaker+Law+Car+Accident+and+Personal+Injury+Lawyers+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10235+111+St+NW+Unit+6%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5K+2V5","website":"https://watchmakerlaw.com","blurb":"Personal Injury / Civil Litigation in Edmonton. Rated 5.0 from 121 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/watchmaker-law-car-accident-and-personal-injury-lawyers-edmonton.png"}','{"1":[["00:00","23:59"]],"2":[["00:00","23:59"]],"3":[["00:00","23:59"]],"4":[["00:00","23:59"]],"5":[["00:00","23:59"]],"6":[["00:00","23:59"]],"7":[["00:00","23:59"]]}','Watchmaker Law is an Edmonton firm handling car accident, personal injury and civil litigation matters for clients across Alberta.

Founder David Sowemimo represents plaintiffs in serious and catastrophic injury cases, from paraplegic and quadriplegic injuries to multi-fatality collisions, and the site says he draws on alternative dispute resolution experience. Associates Wura Oshodi and Erin Castro are also listed, and the site lists English and Yoruba. Its injury pages explain psychological injuries, fractures, traumatic brain injuries, whiplash, burns and chronic pain. The firm works on a contingency fee basis and offers flexible meeting options for clients whose injuries make travel difficult.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('shore-and-johnston-barristers-at-law-ottawa','Shore & Johnston, Barristers-at-Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,5,119,45.4208205,-75.6940175,'{"name":"Shore & Johnston, Barristers-at-Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Family Law"],"caseTypes":["criminal","family"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4208205,"lng":-75.6940175,"address":"141 Laurier Ave W Ste 600, Ottawa, ON K1P 5J3","phone":"+16132337747","rating":5,"count":119,"slug":"shore-and-johnston-barristers-at-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Shore+%26+Johnston%2C+Barristers-at-Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=141+Laurier+Ave+W+Ste+600%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K1P+5J3","website":"https://www.sjhdlaw.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Family Law in Ottawa. Rated 5.0 from 119 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/shore-and-johnston-barristers-at-law-ottawa.png"}',NULL,'Shore & Johnston, Barristers-at-Law is an Ottawa criminal defence firm handling bail, driving, drug, domestic, sexual and homicide charges.

The firm says it has helped clients through criminal charges in Ontario for fifty years under the Criminal Code and the Controlled Drugs and Substances Act, and has also acted in regulatory prosecutions ranging from the Ontario Highway Traffic Act to the Canadian Lobbying Act. Its lawyers appear at bail hearings, on guilty pleas and sentencing, in judge-alone and jury trials, and on appeal. Michael Johnston is named on the site, which also explains Charter rights, including the presumption of innocence.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('oakley-family-law-calgary','Oakley Family Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.6,127,50.9499567,-113.9929243,'{"name":"Oakley Family Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":50.9499567,"lng":-113.9929243,"address":"3150 114 Ave SE, Calgary, AB T2Z 3V6","phone":"+15879431394","rating":4.6,"count":127,"slug":"oakley-family-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Oakley+Family+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=3150+114+Ave+SE%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2Z+3V6","website":"https://www.oakleyfamilylaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Calgary. Rated 4.6 from 127 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/oakley-family-law-calgary.png"}',NULL,'Oakley Family Law is a Calgary firm that supports clients through divorce, starting a new family and estate planning.

The site marks the firm''s 10th anniversary and includes a message from founding lawyer Melissa Oakley, who says the practice has worked with thousands of individuals through major life transitions over the decade. It lists core values of honesty and transparency, collaboration, integrity, client service and respect for differences, and says everyone is welcome. Its description also uses the phrases Calgary family lawyer and Calgary divorce lawyer, and the office is in southeast Calgary.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('smith-employment-law-toronto','Smith Employment Law','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,5,112,43.6481452,-79.3846606,'{"name":"Smith Employment Law","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["employment"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6481452,"lng":-79.3846606,"address":"150 King St W Ste 257, Toronto, ON M5H 3B7","phone":"+14168060732","rating":5,"count":112,"slug":"smith-employment-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Smith+Employment+Law+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=150+King+St+W+Ste+257%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5H+3B7","website":"https://smithemploymentlaw.ca","blurb":"Employment Law in Toronto. Rated 5.0 from 112 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/smith-employment-law-toronto.webp"}',NULL,'Smith Employment Law is a Toronto practice that acts for both employees and employers in employment law matters.

The firm is led by Waheeda Ekhlas Smith, who practises as WES Law Professional Corporation and, according to the site, worked as a legal assistant for many years beginning at age 18 before becoming a lawyer. Its pages refer to severance negotiations and assessments of job offers and employment contracts, and the firm says it seeks early resolution before matters reach court while staying ready to advance or defend a client''s position when necessary. The about page also lists community involvement, education, representative work and speaking engagements.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('gad-pariente-montreal','Gad Pariente','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.8,115,45.5048906,-73.5543837,'{"name":"Gad Pariente","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.5048906,"lng":-73.5543837,"address":"83 Rue St-Paul Ouest, Montréal, QC H2Y 3T3","phone":"+15149616222","rating":4.8,"count":115,"slug":"gad-pariente-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Gad+Pariente+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=83+Rue+St-Paul+Ouest%2C+Montr%C3%A9al%2C+QC+H2Y+3T3","website":"https://sponsorshipattorney.ca","blurb":"Immigration in Montreal. Rated 4.8 from 115 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/gad-pariente-montreal.png"}',NULL,'Gad Pariente is a Montreal immigration lawyer who handles spousal and common-law partner sponsorship applications for clients across Canada.

