The firm says it was founded in 1999 and acts for local, American and international clients in high-stakes matters across Alberta''s key industries. Its service pages also list alternative dispute resolution, health law, immigration, estate planning and business law. The employment and labour group is described as one of the largest in Calgary, advising both employers and employees across Alberta and western Canada. Lawyers named on the site include Roxanne Davis, KC, and Michael Waite, KC. Its approach is described as practical, client-centred and tailored to each case.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('pender-litigation-vancouver','Pender Litigation','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.7,50,49.2751066,-123.1220961,'{"name":"Pender Litigation","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["litigation"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2751066,"lng":-123.1220961,"address":"1168 Hamilton St Suite 506, Vancouver, BC V6B 2S2","phone":"+16046696699","rating":4.7,"count":50,"slug":"pender-litigation-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Pender+Litigation+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1168+Hamilton+St+Suite+506%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V6B+2S2","website":"https://www.penderlitigation.com","blurb":"Civil Litigation in Vancouver. Rated 4.7 from 50 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/pender-litigation-vancouver.webp"}',NULL,'Pender Litigation is a Vancouver criminal defence firm covering driving, sexual and violent offences in British Columbia courts.

The firm says its lawyers have also acted as ad hoc prosecutors, which lets them see cases from both sides. Its site describes work that spans minor offences, large complex cases, appeals and related applications. Driving law is called a cornerstone of the practice, with attention to the strict time limits that apply to challenges involving driving privileges. Pender Litigation says it examines the evidence in detail, explains how the justice system works, and takes a collaborative, team-based approach to each case.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('annette-lefebvre-avocats-montreal','Annette Lefebvre Avocats','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.6,50,45.4987839,-73.5786722,'{"name":"Annette Lefebvre Avocats","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.4987839,"lng":-73.5786722,"address":"2185 Rue Crescent, Montréal, QC H3G 2C1","phone":"+15142881114","rating":4.6,"count":50,"slug":"annette-lefebvre-avocats-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Annette+Lefebvre+Avocats+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2185+Rue+Crescent%2C+Montr%C3%A9al%2C+QC+H3G+2C1","website":"https://www.annettelefebvre.com","blurb":"Personal Injury in Montreal. Rated 4.6 from 50 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/annette-lefebvre-avocats-montreal.webp"}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Annette Lefebvre Avocats is a Montreal firm representing patients and accident victims in medical malpractice and personal injury cases.

The firm''s website says it acts only for patients and victims, including in birth injury, spinal cord injury and chiropractic injury claims against doctors, medical institutions, building owners and insurers. It reports more than forty years of experience. Annette Lefebvre is a former intensive care nurse who has spent over thirty years on malpractice and injury suits, and Melissa Lonn has devoted her practice to the same fields, drawing on a background in social work and science. The site lists Montreal, Laval, Longueuil and Brossard among the areas served.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('purves-smith-law-guelph','Purves-Smith Law','Guelph','ON','waterloo-guelph',0,4.6,49,43.544372,-80.2480463,'{"name":"Purves-Smith Law","city":"Guelph","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"waterloo-guelph","province":"ON","lat":43.544372,"lng":-80.2480463,"address":"2 Wyndham St N, Guelph, ON N1H 4E3","phone":"+15198352100","rating":4.6,"count":49,"slug":"purves-smith-law-guelph","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Purves-Smith+Law+Guelph+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2+Wyndham+St+N%2C+Guelph%2C+ON+N1H+4E3","website":"https://www.purvessmithlaw.com","blurb":"Family Law in Guelph. Rated 4.6 from 49 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/purves-smith-law-guelph.png"}',NULL,'Purves-Smith Law is a Guelph family law practice serving Guelph and Kitchener-Waterloo on custody, support, property and child protection matters.

Lawyer Michael D. Purves-Smith, an Osgoode Hall Law School graduate who received the Morden prize in Evidence Law, focuses on high-conflict and complex files. The site lists custody disputes, guideline child support, imputation of income, property equalization involving business, corporate and farm assets, pensions, occupation rent, domestic contracts, and Children''s Aid Society matters. The firm also offers mediated settlement of family issues and accepts Legal Aid certificates case by case. Its homepage describes him as a family and criminal lawyer.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('colautti-landry-partners-windsor','Colautti Landry Partners','Windsor','ON','southwestern',0,4.8,46,42.2845311,-83.0193176,'{"name":"Colautti Landry Partners","city":"Windsor","featured":false,"tags":["Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["litigation"],"region":"southwestern","province":"ON","lat":42.2845311,"lng":-83.0193176,"address":"2555 Ouellette Ave Bldg 140, Suite 200, Windsor, ON N8X 1L9","phone":"+15199661300","rating":4.8,"count":46,"slug":"colautti-landry-partners-windsor","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Colautti+Landry+Partners+Windsor+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2555+Ouellette+Ave+Bldg+140%2C+Suite+200%2C+Windsor%2C+ON+N8X+1L9","website":"https://www.clplaw.net","blurb":"Civil Litigation in Windsor. Rated 4.8 from 46 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/colautti-landry-partners-windsor.jpg"}',NULL,'Colautti Landry Partners, known as CLP Law, is a Windsor firm handling civil litigation, corporate and commercial matters, and wills and estates.

The firm says two of its lawyers hold Law Society of Ontario certification in civil litigation, one of only five such certifications in Windsor. Senior partner Raymond Colautti has over forty years of litigation experience, including appearances before the Supreme Court of Canada and a federal security intelligence oversight committee. Managing partner Anita Landry focuses on commercial disputes, fraud, trust and estate claims and appeals, and also runs a private mediation practice. Andrew Colautti handles construction, development and lien litigation, and holds law degrees from Ontario and Michigan.','dynamic','live',NULL);
