According to its website, the firm also offers mediation services and describes itself as a dispute resolution practice built on a team approach. Sean Pihl, K.C., is among the lawyers listed, alongside Andrew Prior, Alexander Spraggs, Calen Janzen, Connor Elliott, Emily Bowen and Avery Barnett. The firm says it explains the legal process to clients, gives them a candid view of their case, and will refer a client to another professional when that serves them better. Its articles discuss toxic torts and commercial leases.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('sutherland-criminal-defence-edmonton','Sutherland Criminal Defence','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,4.9,44,53.5369896,-113.5034157,'{"name":"Sutherland Criminal Defence","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.5369896,"lng":-113.5034157,"address":"9844 106 St 3rd floor, Edmonton, AB T5K 1B8","phone":"+15874159855","rating":4.9,"count":44,"slug":"sutherland-criminal-defence-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sutherland+Criminal+Defence+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=9844+106+St+3rd+floor%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5K+1B8","website":"https://sutherlandcriminaldefence.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Edmonton. Rated 4.9 from 44 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/sutherland-criminal-defence-edmonton.webp"}',NULL,'Sutherland Criminal Defence is an Edmonton firm led by Ellen Sutherland, handling sexual offences, domestic violence, driving charges and murder cases.

Her website says she has tried cases across Alberta, Saskatchewan and British Columbia, appearing in the Court of King''s Bench and the Alberta Court of Appeal. She also appears before tribunals, including the Parole Board of Canada and SafeRoads Alberta. Listed practice areas include drug offences, violent offences, criminal driving offences and parole board assistance, and the firm advertises emergency and bail help at all hours. Ms. Sutherland holds a B.A. and J.D., and the site says the firm acts for clients across Western Canada.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('tcz-law-toronto','TCZ Law','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,5,43,43.6423271,-79.3773332,'{"name":"TCZ Law","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6423271,"lng":-79.3773332,"address":"20 Bay St. #1100, Toronto, ON M5J 2N8","phone":"+16474786560","rating":5,"count":43,"slug":"tcz-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/TCZ+Law+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=20+Bay+St.+%231100%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5J+2N8","website":"https://tczlaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Toronto. Rated 5.0 from 43 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/tcz-law-toronto.webp"}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]],"7":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','TCZ Law is a Toronto family law firm handling divorce, separation, custody, support and domestic contracts, with its site offered in English and Chinese.

Lawyer Eric Tianchuan Zhao represents clients in negotiation and, when needed, in court. His website lists custody and access, child support, spousal support, division of property, marriage contracts, cohabitation agreements and motions to change. The firm says it provides a draft separation agreement or marriage contract within five business days of receiving the needed information. Before opening his own practice he worked at Baker McKenzie LLP, McInnis & Nicoll and Mahdi Leite Family Law LPP, and the firm lists downtown and North York locations.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('guberman-appleby-immigration-lawyers-toronto','Guberman Appleby Immigration Lawyers','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,5,43,43.6770243,-79.4013612,'{"name":"Guberman Appleby Immigration Lawyers","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6770243,"lng":-79.4013612,"address":"287 Macpherson Ave Unit 201, Toronto, ON M4V 1A4","phone":"+14165487100","rating":5,"count":43,"slug":"guberman-appleby-immigration-lawyers-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Guberman+Appleby+Immigration+Lawyers+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=287+Macpherson+Ave+Unit+201%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M4V+1A4","website":"https://gaimmigrationlawyers.com","blurb":"Immigration in Toronto. Rated 5.0 from 43 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/guberman-appleby-immigration-lawyers-toronto.webp"}',NULL,'Guberman Appleby Immigration Lawyers is a Toronto firm advising on Canadian and U.S. immigration, from work permits and Express Entry to business immigration.

The firm says its lawyers have more than seventy years of combined experience and act for individuals, families, entrepreneurs and multinational employers. Joel S. Guberman and Lainie Michelle Appleby are named on the site, which lists memberships in the Law Society of Ontario, the Canadian Bar Association, CILA, AILA and the Massachusetts Bar. Its pages cover family sponsorship, permanent residence and U.S. visas. Based in Toronto, the firm says it serves clients across Canada, the United States and abroad, and describes its guidance as plain-language, with realistic timelines.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('laredo-law-toronto','Laredo Law','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,5,43,43.7008148,-79.3864661,'{"name":"Laredo Law","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["wills"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7008148,"lng":-79.3864661,"address":"250 Davisville Ave Ste 108, Toronto, ON M4S 1H2","phone":"+14164823328","rating":5,"count":43,"slug":"laredo-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Laredo+Law+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=250+Davisville+Ave+Ste+108%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M4S+1H2","website":"https://www.laredolaw.ca","blurb":"Wills & Estates in Toronto. Rated 5.0 from 43 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/laredo-law-toronto.png"}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]],"7":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Laredo Law is a Toronto estates firm preparing wills, trusts and tax-aware succession plans and acting in estate administration.

The firm says it was founded in 2007 by Lisa Laredo, a Certified Trust and Estate Practitioner through STEP Canada who belongs to the Canadian Bar Association, the Ontario Bar Association and the Estate Planning Council of Canada. She also teaches accredited programs for lawyers and writes for legal journals. Associate lawyer Ana Wagner and a legal administrative assistant are named on the team page. The website also has a real estate law section, and a blog that explains wills and estates topics in plain language. The office is on Davisville Avenue.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('h-and-h-law-group-mississauga','H&H Law Group','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,5,43,43.5999908,-79.608348,'{"name":"H&H Law Group","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5999908,"lng":-79.608348,"address":"3292 Cawthra Rd, Mississauga, ON L5A 2X7","phone":"+14165727483","rating":5,"count":43,"slug":"h-and-h-law-group-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/H%26H+Law+Group+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=3292+Cawthra+Rd%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5A+2X7","website":"https://hhlawgroup.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Mississauga. Rated 5.0 from 43 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/h-and-h-law-group-mississauga.png"}','{"1":[["09:00","18:00"]],"2":[["09:00","18:00"]],"3":[["09:00","18:00"]],"4":[["09:00","18:00"]],"5":[["09:00","18:00"]]}','H&H Law Group is a Mississauga firm covering family law, corporate law, real estate, wills and estates, and immigration for clients across Ontario.

Its website says offices are on Cawthra Road and at Village Centre Place in Mississauga, with a third in Oakville, and that it serves Peel, Halton and the wider Greater Toronto Area, plus other clients by video. The firm argues that family, business and property problems overlap, so one team handles them together. Lawyers offer service in English, Pashto, Urdu, Punjabi and Hindi. A real estate article examines title problems, closing costs, condominium status certificates and hidden defects, and the firm says clients receive a written plan from the first meeting.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('browne-criminal-defence-calgary','Browne Criminal Defence','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,5,43,51.0363027,-114.0943785,'{"name":"Browne Criminal Defence","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["criminal","litigation"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0363027,"lng":-114.0943785,"address":"1842 14 St SW, Calgary, AB T2T 3S9","phone":"+14033330992","rating":5,"count":43,"slug":"browne-criminal-defence-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Browne+Criminal+Defence+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1842+14+St+SW%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2T+3S9","website":"https://bcdlaw.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Civil Litigation in Calgary. Rated 5.0 from 43 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/browne-criminal-defence-calgary.webp"}',NULL,'Browne Criminal Defence is a Calgary practice where lawyer Matt Browne works only on criminal law in Alberta and British Columbia.

Before law school he earned a Bachelor of Science in Chemical Engineering at the University of Alberta and worked for oil and gas companies in North America and Southeast Asia, from heavy oil in Fort McMurray to natural gas in the Gulf of Thailand. The firm''s site says he draws on that science background when forensic evidence is at issue in court. He has appeared at all levels of court in both provinces. Its pages walk through disclosure analysis, the criminal process and strategy meetings.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('reich-law-calgary','Reich Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.8,44,51.087635,-114.157957,'{"name":"Reich Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.087635,"lng":-114.157957,"address":"4935 40 Ave NW, Calgary, AB T3A 2N1","phone":"+14039844868","rating":4.8,"count":44,"slug":"reich-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Reich+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4935+40+Ave+NW%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T3A+2N1","website":"https://www.reichlaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Calgary. Rated 4.8 from 44 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/reich-law-calgary.png"}',NULL,'Reich Law is a Calgary real estate firm handling commercial and residential property work, including foreclosure, restrictive covenants and related litigation.

The firm''s website describes itself as founded and based in Calgary, Alberta, and says it has built a practice focused on its clients over many years. Its search description refers to nearly thirty years of commercial and residential real estate law experience. The service pages are organized around four headings: real estate, foreclosure, restrictive covenants and litigation. The office is on 40 Avenue NW in northwest Calgary. The site says the firm works to build long-lasting relationships with the people it represents.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('longfield-law-professional-corporation-brampton','Longfield Law Professional Corporation','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,4.8,44,43.6922418,-79.769101,'{"name":"Longfield Law Professional Corporation","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6922418,"lng":-79.769101,"address":"303 Main St N, Brampton, ON L6X 1N5","phone":"+19054528622","rating":4.8,"count":44,"slug":"longfield-law-professional-corporation-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Longfield+Law+Professional+Corporation+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=303+Main+St+N%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6X+1N5","website":"https://www.longfieldlaw.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Brampton. Rated 4.8 from 44 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/longfield-law-professional-corporation-brampton.png"}',NULL,'Longfield Law Professional Corporation is a family-operated Brampton firm covering real estate, wills, estates and trusts, and corporate and business law.

Its website says Randall A. Longfield founded the firm in 1986, his son Michael joined in 2013, and Meaghan Longfield joined in 2019 to oversee the corporate department. Clients are served throughout Peel and Halton, including Caledon, Bolton, Georgetown, Halton Hills, Oakville, Burlington, Mississauga and Milton. Real estate work includes residential and commercial purchases and sales, mortgage financing and refinancing, private mortgages and title insurance. The estates side prepares wills and powers of attorney, and assists executors with administration and probate.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('demelo-heathcote-london','DeMelo Heathcote','London','ON','southwestern',0,4.6,45,42.9824211,-81.2382711,'{"name":"DeMelo Heathcote","city":"London","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"southwestern","province":"ON","lat":42.9824211,"lng":-81.2382711,"address":"275 Colborne St, London, ON N6B 2S7","phone":"+15192047966","rating":4.6,"count":45,"slug":"demelo-heathcote-london","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/DeMelo+Heathcote+London+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=275+Colborne+St%2C+London%2C+ON+N6B+2S7","website":"https://www.demelolaw.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in London. Rated 4.6 from 45 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/demelo-heathcote-london.png"}',NULL,'DeMelo Heathcote is a London, Ontario criminal defence firm handling Criminal Code, drug and provincial offences, plus appeals, across Southwestern Ontario.

According to its website, Cassandra DeMelo founded the firm in 2014 and Katie Heathcote became a partner in 2022; the site says the firm now has fourteen people. Other lawyers named include Shayne Stroud and Adriana D''Arpino. Its practice pages cover domestic charges, possession for the purpose of trafficking, regulatory and by-law matters, and appellate work up to the Supreme Court of Canada. The firm offers service in English, French, Portuguese and Spanish, and its office is on Colborne Street in London.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('tarnow-criminal-law-richmond','Tarnow Criminal Law','Richmond','BC','bc-richmond',0,4.7,44,49.1699648,-123.1423539,'{"name":"Tarnow Criminal Law","city":"Richmond","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["criminal","litigation"],"region":"bc-richmond","province":"BC","lat":49.1699648,"lng":-123.1423539,"address":"7340 Westminster Hwy Unit 210, Richmond, BC V6X 1A1","phone":"+16042780555","rating":4.7,"count":44,"slug":"tarnow-criminal-law-richmond","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Tarnow+Criminal+Law+Richmond+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=7340+Westminster+Hwy+Unit+210%2C+Richmond%2C+BC+V6X+1A1","website":"https://www.tarnowcriminallaw.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Civil Litigation in Richmond. Rated 4.7 from 44 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/tarnow-criminal-law-richmond.png"}',NULL,'Tarnow Criminal Law is a Richmond, British Columbia criminal defence firm acting for people charged with offences throughout Metro Vancouver.

Brothers David Tarnow and Jason Tarnow lead the practice, which the site describes as full-service and based on decades of combined criminal law experience. They describe themselves as trial lawyers by nature who treat guilty pleas and plea bargains as a last resort. The firm names Vancouver, Surrey and Richmond as places where it appears in court, along with the wider region of British Columbia, and its structured data also lists Yukon. Its pages emphasize Charter rights and the right to legal counsel. The office is on Westminster Highway in Richmond.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('avtar-bhangal-mississauga','Avtar Bhangal','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,4.8,43,43.6399104,-79.7138532,'{"name":"Avtar Bhangal","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["criminal","litigation"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6399104,"lng":-79.7138532,"address":"295 Derry Rd W, Mississauga, ON L5W 1G3","phone":"+14166164211","rating":4.8,"count":43,"slug":"avtar-bhangal-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Avtar+Bhangal+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=295+Derry+Rd+W%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5W+1G3","website":"https://www.bhangallaw.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Civil Litigation in Mississauga. Rated 4.8 from 43 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/avtar-bhangal-mississauga.webp"}',NULL,'Avtar Bhangal practises as Bhangal Law, a Mississauga criminal defence firm handling assaults, impaired driving, fraud, theft and drug charges.

The firm''s website says it has over thirty years of courtroom experience between its lawyers. Avtar Bhangal has been a member of the Law Society of Ontario, formerly the Law Society of Upper Canada, since 1994, and Savena Bhangal since 2022. The firm states that it has handled thousands of criminal matters, keeps clients informed about their case, and guides them through the criminal justice process. The office is on Derry Road West in Mississauga, Ontario.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('tz-law-calgary','TZ Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,5,41,51.0429453,-114.0760424,'{"name":"TZ Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["employment"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0429453,"lng":-114.0760424,"address":"638 11 Ave SW #200, Calgary, AB T2R 0E2","phone":"+15872105618","rating":5,"count":41,"slug":"tz-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/TZ+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=638+11+Ave+SW+%23200%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2R+0E2","website":"https://www.tzlawyers.ca","blurb":"Employment Law in Calgary. Rated 5.0 from 41 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/tz-law-calgary.png"}',NULL,'TZ Law is a Calgary boutique handling employment, human rights and privacy law for employees and employers across Alberta and British Columbia.

Its website covers wrongful termination, discrimination, privacy and contractual matters, and says the firm advises people on whether to accept a severance offer or sign a release. It also acts for businesses, including start-ups and entrepreneurs dealing with growth, compliance and risk. Fee options are listed as contingency, hourly and hybrid arrangements. The firm says it provides its full range of services in both English and Mandarin. Its office is on 11 Avenue SW in downtown Calgary.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('dolgin-family-law-ottawa','Dolgin Family Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,5,41,45.4161173,-75.6953848,'{"name":"Dolgin Family Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4161173,"lng":-75.6953848,"address":"331 Somerset St W, Ottawa, ON K2P 0J8","phone":"+16138002218","rating":5,"count":41,"slug":"dolgin-family-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Dolgin+Family+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=331+Somerset+St+W%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K2P+0J8","website":"https://dolginfamilylaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Ottawa. Rated 5.0 from 41 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/dolgin-family-law-ottawa.png"}',NULL,'Dolgin Family Law is an Ottawa family practice led by Jeremy Dolgin, who acts for clients in Ottawa, elsewhere in Ontario and abroad.

His profile says he has practised family law for almost thirty years since graduating from the University of Toronto Faculty of Law in 1997. He represents clients at the Ontario Court of Justice, the Superior Court of Justice and the Ontario Court of Appeal. He is a trained mediator and a founding member of the collaborative law network of Ottawa, and he says many of his files are settled through non-adversarial processes. Gabriel Bidner is also named on the team page. The office is on Somerset Street West.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('the-law-offices-of-nikolas-j-lust-ottawa','The Law Offices of Nikolas J. Lust','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.7,43,45.4161173,-75.6953848,'{"name":"The Law Offices of Nikolas J. Lust","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4161173,"lng":-75.6953848,"address":"331 Somerset St W, Ottawa, ON K2P 0J8","phone":"+16132332542","rating":4.7,"count":43,"slug":"the-law-offices-of-nikolas-j-lust-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/The+Law+Offices+of+Nikolas+J.+Lust+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=331+Somerset+St+W%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K2P+0J8","website":"https://www.nikolaslust.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Ottawa. Rated 4.7 from 43 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/the-law-offices-of-nikolas-j-lust-ottawa.webp"}',NULL,'Nikolas Lust runs an Ottawa criminal defence practice focused on sexual assault, domestic assault, impaired driving and drug trafficking.

Nikolas Lust says he also represents clients charged with first-degree murder, firearms offences and aggravated assault, from students to professionals. The site describes a service model built on video, telephone or in-person meetings, with documents exchanged and bills paid online, so clients can take part from home. The office is downtown at Somerset Street West, and the firm says it serves clients across Ontario. A blog series walks through the preliminary inquiry, court appearances and resolution.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('eidelmann-law-inc-montreal','Eidelmann Law Inc','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.7,43,45.497555,-73.6593055,'{"name":"Eidelmann Law Inc","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.497555,"lng":-73.6593055,"address":"8000 Bd Décarie, Montréal, QC H4P 2S4","phone":"+15145386966","rating":4.7,"count":43,"slug":"eidelmann-law-inc-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Eidelmann+Law+Inc+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=8000+Bd+D%C3%A9carie%2C+Montr%C3%A9al%2C+QC+H4P+2S4","website":"https://www.eidelmannlaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Montreal. Rated 4.7 from 43 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/eidelmann-law-inc-montreal.png"}','{"1":[["09:00","17:30"]],"2":[["09:00","17:30"]],"3":[["09:00","17:30"]],"4":[["09:00","17:30"]],"5":[["09:00","17:30"]]}','Eidelmann Law Inc is a bilingual Montreal litigation boutique handling business, real estate, labour, debt collection and civil matters.

Founded by Me Adam Eidelmann, a litigator who also runs a business, the firm says it weighs the economic consequences of a legal strategy before recommending it. Its pages describe contract work under the Civil Code of Quebec, including drafting, analysis and enforcement when a deal breaks down. Service is offered in English and French to a local and international clientele from its office on Boulevard Decarie. The firm presents itself as deliberately small, with the founder handling every file.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('szakacs-law-injury-lawyers-calgary-calgary','Szakacs Law Injury Lawyers Calgary','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.8,42,50.9893367,-114.0502489,'{"name":"Szakacs Law Injury Lawyers Calgary","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":50.9893367,"lng":-114.0502489,"address":"550 71 Ave SE Ste 240, Calgary, AB T2H 0H6","phone":"+15876008996","rating":4.8,"count":42,"slug":"szakacs-law-injury-lawyers-calgary-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Szakacs+Law+Injury+Lawyers+Calgary+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=550+71+Ave+SE+Ste+240%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2H+0H6","website":"https://szakacslaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Calgary. Rated 4.8 from 42 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/szakacs-law-injury-lawyers-calgary-calgary.webp"}','{"1":[["09:00","16:30"]],"2":[["09:00","16:30"]],"3":[["09:00","16:30"]],"4":[["09:00","16:30"]],"5":[["09:00","16:30"]]}','Szakacs Law Injury Lawyers is a Calgary personal injury firm that represented people hurt in car, truck, motorcycle and pedestrian accidents.

Its website says founder Dale Szakacs defended insurance companies before switching sides, and that the firm had offices in Calgary and Edmonton and served Red Deer, Lethbridge, St. Albert, Sherwood Park and St. Paul. Lawyers named include Sandra C.M. Folkins and Bridget Belsher. A notice on the site says Mr. Szakacs retired after more than thirty-five years in practice and that the firm transitioned its practice to Cuming & Gillespie LLP.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('portfolio-estate-law-etobicoke','Portfolio Estate Law','Etobicoke','ON','toronto',0,5,40,43.6452349,-79.5107757,'{"name":"Portfolio Estate Law","city":"Etobicoke","featured":false,"tags":["Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["wills"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6452349,"lng":-79.5107757,"address":"900 Royal York Rd, Etobicoke, ON M8Y 2V6","phone":"+14169935996","rating":5,"count":40,"slug":"portfolio-estate-law-etobicoke","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Portfolio+Estate+Law+Etobicoke+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=900+Royal+York+Rd%2C+Etobicoke%2C+ON+M8Y+2V6","website":"https://portfoliolaw.ca","blurb":"Wills & Estates in Etobicoke. Rated 5.0 from 40 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/portfolio-estate-law-etobicoke.png"}',NULL,'Portfolio Estate Law is an Etobicoke firm handling tax and estate planning, estate administration and fiduciary services for international clients.

Founder Birute Luksenaite holds a law degree from Queen''s University and arts degrees from the University of Toronto, and articled at the Tax Court of Canada. She later worked in tax law at a national firm, a global accounting firm and a bank. The site lists powers of attorney, family, spousal and alter ego trusts, estate freezes and beneficiary designations, offers tax and succession planning for artists'' estates, and says it assists vulnerable persons.','dynamic','live',NULL);
