Its website lists Express Entry, family sponsorship, humanitarian and compassionate applications, Ontario nominee programs, and work and study permits. Jasmin Sandhu is a member of the Law Society and an Ontario Notary Public, and the site says she belongs to JusticeNet and the Legal Aid panel. Ireesha Jethanandani, a licensed paralegal, is the first person clients meet. Areas served include Ajax, Woodbridge, Vaughan, Mississauga, Brampton, Whitby, Oshawa and Barrie, and the firm lists several language options.','dynamic','live',NULL);
