According to its website, the litigation side covers disputes over estate administration, the passing of estate trustee accounts, conflicts among beneficiaries, undue influence, upholding or challenging a will, and dependant''s relief. The firm also deals with probate and the appointment of estate trustees, and it says a Certificate of Appointment typically issues within two to three months. Guardianship appointments and living trusts are listed as well, and the site publishes plain-language pages on the Ontario estate administration tax and on guardianship. The office is in Scarborough.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('mark-chiu-law-kelowna','Mark Chiu Law','Kelowna','BC','bc-okanagan',0,5,36,49.8848348,-119.4953366,'{"name":"Mark Chiu Law","city":"Kelowna","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["family","criminal"],"region":"bc-okanagan","province":"BC","lat":49.8848348,"lng":-119.4953366,"address":"1630 Pandosy St #204, Kelowna, BC V1Y 1P7","phone":"+17789401425","rating":5,"count":36,"slug":"mark-chiu-law-kelowna","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Mark+Chiu+Law+Kelowna+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1630+Pandosy+St+%23204%2C+Kelowna%2C+BC+V1Y+1P7","website":"https://www.markchiu.com","blurb":"Family Law / Criminal Defence in Kelowna. Rated 5.0 from 36 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/mark-chiu-law-kelowna.png"}',NULL,'Mark Chiu Law is a Kelowna practice handling family law and criminal law matters in the Okanagan, the Kootenays and elsewhere in British Columbia.

The lawyer behind Mark J. Chiu Law Corp, Mark Chiu, has practised in British Columbia since 2014 and holds degrees in psychology from the University of Calgary and law from the University of Saskatchewan. He is also certified as a family law mediator through the Law Society of British Columbia. His site says he has acted for the Public Prosecution Service of Canada, as defence counsel in serious matters, and in family cases involving the Family Maintenance Enforcement Program and the Ministry of Children and Family Development. Family work includes dividing property held through corporations or trusts and parenting disputes involving alienation.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('munro-and-crawford-vancouver','Munro & Crawford','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.8,37,49.2351609,-123.1574071,'{"name":"Munro & Crawford","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["wills"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2351609,"lng":-123.1574071,"address":"5670 Yew St, Vancouver, BC V6M 3Y3","phone":"+16042667174","rating":4.8,"count":37,"slug":"munro-and-crawford-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Munro+%26+Crawford+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=5670+Yew+St%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V6M+3Y3","website":"https://munrocrawford.ca","blurb":"Wills & Estates in Vancouver. Rated 4.8 from 37 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/munro-and-crawford-vancouver.png"}',NULL,'Munro & Crawford is a Kerrisdale firm in Vancouver handling wills, trusts, probate, real estate and business law since 1952.

The firm began as a single office opened by founding partner William Munro, and Peter Crawford joined him in 1973. Its client base has since spread across the Lower Mainland and to other provinces, according to its site. Estate services include guidance for executors, wills and trusts, and elder care matters. On the business side it lists incorporation, acting as registered and records office, minute books, shareholder and joint venture agreements, and advice on purchases, sales and reorganizations.','dynamic','live',NULL);
