According to the site, Brett McGarry has been licensed by the Law Society of Ontario since 2008 and has more than 18 years of criminal defence practice in Ottawa and across the province. He is described as acting for many clients who are professionals with no earlier involvement in the criminal justice system. The firm publishes case summaries involving Charter rulings and trials in the Superior Court, and a separate page on Ottawa impaired driving charges covers over 80, refusing a breath sample and care-and-control offences.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('grewal-law-firm-ottawa','Grewal Law Firm','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,5,35,45.3479833,-75.9249665,'{"name":"Grewal Law Firm","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.3479833,"lng":-75.9249665,"address":"603 March Rd #200S, Kanata, ON K2K 2M5","phone":"+16132619897","rating":5,"count":35,"slug":"grewal-law-firm-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Grewal+Law+Firm+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=603+March+Rd+%23200S%2C+Kanata%2C+ON+K2K+2M5","website":"https://grewallawfirm.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Ottawa. Rated 5.0 from 35 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/grewal-law-firm-ottawa.webp"}',NULL,'Grewal Law Firm provides family law services in Ottawa and nearby areas, including separation, divorce, child support and parenting time.

Manraj (Manny) Grewal has practised since 2019 and founded the firm in 2021. His site lists clients in Ottawa, Lanark County, Prescott, Russell, Cornwall, L''Orignal, Embrun, Hawkesbury and Casselman. Services include decision-making authority, extraordinary expenses, division of assets, child protection matters involving the children''s aid society, court assistance, mediation, and cohabitation, prenuptial and postnuptial agreements. The firm says it tries to resolve matters through negotiation first and moves to court only when that is not possible. Its office is in Kanata.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('blw-injury-law-waterloo','BLW Injury Law','Waterloo','ON','waterloo-guelph',0,5,35,43.5115114,-80.5352254,'{"name":"BLW Injury Law","city":"Waterloo","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"waterloo-guelph","province":"ON","lat":43.5115114,"lng":-80.5352254,"address":"86 Rankin St Unit 2, Waterloo, ON N2V 1V9","phone":"+12264995287","rating":5,"count":35,"slug":"blw-injury-law-waterloo","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/BLW+Injury+Law+Waterloo+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=86+Rankin+St+Unit+2%2C+Waterloo%2C+ON+N2V+1V9","website":"https://blwlaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Waterloo. Rated 5.0 from 35 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/blw-injury-law-waterloo.png"}','{"1":[["06:00","23:00"]],"2":[["06:00","23:00"]],"3":[["06:00","23:00"]],"4":[["06:00","23:00"]],"5":[["06:00","23:00"]],"6":[["06:00","23:00"]],"7":[["06:00","23:00"]]}','BLW Injury Law is a Waterloo personal injury firm handling car accidents, slip and falls, motorcycle and pedestrian injuries, and public transit accidents.

The firm describes itself as a member of the Barapp Law Alliance. Its practice list also includes orthopaedic injuries and traumatic brain and spinal cord injuries, each with its own page on the site. According to the firm, clients are assigned a case manager and work on a contingency fee basis, meaning no fees are owed unless the case succeeds. The site also explains the time limits for filing a public transit accident lawsuit and the kinds of compensation that may be available.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('modern-family-law-llp-toronto','Modern Family Law LLP','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.8,36,43.7306205,-79.419399,'{"name":"Modern Family Law LLP","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.7306205,"lng":-79.419399,"address":"1810 Avenue Rd Ste 300, Toronto, ON M5M 3Z2","phone":"+16473486723","rating":4.8,"count":36,"slug":"modern-family-law-llp-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Modern+Family+Law+LLP+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1810+Avenue+Rd+Ste+300%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5M+3Z2","website":"https://modernfamilylaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Toronto. Rated 4.8 from 36 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/modern-family-law-llp-toronto.png"}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Modern Family Law LLP is a Toronto boutique handling divorce, separation agreements, parenting, support and property division across the GTA.

