The firm was founded in 2021 by Avi Khanna, who says he worked at Toronto corporate firms on mergers and financings before starting it. The team page also names Yash Mehrotra. Its site lists start-up representation, asset purchase agreements, creditors'' rights, contracts, shareholder and partnership agreements, buy-sell agreements, franchise matters and commercial technology transactions. It describes serving clients across Ontario in technology, real estate, e-commerce and professional services, from incorporation through to exit.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('la-rosee-avocat-inc-montreal','LA ROSÉE AVOCAT INC.','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,5,34,45.5587247,-73.6673206,'{"name":"LA ROSÉE AVOCAT INC.","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Civil Litigation","Criminal Defence","Immigration"],"caseTypes":["family","litigation","criminal","immigration"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.5587247,"lng":-73.6673206,"address":"815 Boulevard Henri-Bourassa E bureau 15, Montreal, Quebec H2C 1G1","phone":"+14389852286","rating":5,"count":34,"slug":"la-rosee-avocat-inc-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/LA+ROS%C3%89E+AVOCAT+INC.+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=815+Boulevard+Henri-Bourassa+E+bureau+15%2C+Montreal%2C+Quebec+H2C+1G1","website":"https://laroseeavocatinc.com","blurb":"Family Law / Civil Litigation in Montreal. Rated 5.0 from 34 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/la-rosee-avocat-inc-montreal.webp"}',NULL,'La Rosée Avocat is a Montreal firm handling family, civil, criminal, housing and immigration law from Boulevard Henri-Bourassa Est.

In French, its website lists divorce, child custody and support, contract drafting and disputes, civil liability, criminal defence, visa applications and citizenship procedures. It also mentions youth law, housing law, and mediation of small claims disputes. The firm names transparency, integrity and respect as its values and says it gives weight to the human side of legal work. The site further indicates that it gives private courses in law for people who need help in several subject areas.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('aftermath-law-criminal-defence-mississauga','Aftermath Law: Criminal Defence','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,5,34,43.5749094,-79.621898,'{"name":"Aftermath Law: Criminal Defence","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5749094,"lng":-79.621898,"address":"250 Dundas St W Ste 402, Mississauga, ON L5B 1J2","phone":"+16472231980","rating":5,"count":34,"slug":"aftermath-law-criminal-defence-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Aftermath+Law%3A+Criminal+Defence+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=250+Dundas+St+W+Ste+402%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5B+1J2","website":"https://www.aftermathlaw.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Mississauga. Rated 5.0 from 34 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/aftermath-law-criminal-defence-mississauga.png"}',NULL,'Aftermath Law is a Mississauga criminal defence practice led by Dildeep Sahi, handling assault, domestic assault and sexual assault charges in Peel Region.

According to its website, Dildeep Sahi trained at an Ontario Crown Attorney''s Office and the firm takes urgent matters around the clock. Charges listed include assault with a weapon or causing bodily harm and aggravated assault. The site says it serves thirteen Ontario communities, including Brampton, from its Mississauga office, and that it accepts Legal Aid and offers flat fees. Its structured data lists English, Punjabi and Hindi, and its pages explain how release conditions, a record, travel and immigration status can be affected by a charge.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('barapp-law-firm-and-associates-ottawa','Barapp Law Firm and Associates','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.8,35,45.3299815,-75.7055953,'{"name":"Barapp Law Firm and Associates","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.3299815,"lng":-75.7055953,"address":"43 Auriga Dr Ste 128, Nepean, ON K2E 7Y8","phone":"+18882145428","rating":4.8,"count":35,"slug":"barapp-law-firm-and-associates-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Barapp+Law+Firm+and+Associates+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=43+Auriga+Dr+Ste+128%2C+Nepean%2C+ON+K2E+7Y8","website":"https://barappinjurylaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Ottawa. Rated 4.8 from 35 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/barapp-law-firm-and-associates-ottawa.webp"}',NULL,'Barapp Law Firm and Associates is a personal injury practice in Nepean, near Ottawa, also serving Grimsby and Timmins.

The firm calls itself a member of the Barapp Law Alliance and lists car accidents, orthopaedic injuries, slip and fall, motorcycle, public transit and pedestrian cases. Eric Barapp, a graduate of Osgoode Hall Law School, leads a team that also names Lorne Weinstock, Eti Taylor, Nabeel Sera, Michael Brill, Albert Wong and Aurora Mancuso. According to its site, each client has a case manager who stays involved throughout, and fees are payable only if the case succeeds.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('ayoun-law-mississauga','Ayoun Law','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,4.8,35,43.6217615,-79.6723364,'{"name":"Ayoun Law","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Civil Litigation","Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["family","litigation","realestate"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6217615,"lng":-79.6723364,"address":"25 Watline Ave GR 21, Mississauga, ON L4Z 2Z1","phone":"+19052322793","rating":4.8,"count":35,"slug":"ayoun-law-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Ayoun+Law+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=25+Watline+Ave+GR+21%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L4Z+2Z1","website":"https://ayounlaw.com","blurb":"Family Law / Civil Litigation in Mississauga. Rated 4.8 from 35 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/ayoun-law-mississauga.png"}','{"1":[["09:30","19:00"]],"2":[["09:30","19:00"]],"3":[["09:30","19:00"]],"4":[["09:30","19:00"]],"5":[["09:30","19:00"]]}','Ayoun Law is a Mississauga firm handling family law, real estate, immigration, estate planning and civil litigation across the GTA.

Styled Ayoun & Sabeeya LLP, the firm was founded by Ayoun Haroon and Sabeeya Akram in 2018, and a licensed paralegal and notary later joined it for tribunal matters and notarizations. The site lists Landlord and Tenant Board matters, traffic tickets, independent legal advice and notary services alongside its main practice areas. Lawyers advise in English, Urdu, Punjabi and Hindi, with an assistant supporting Polish-speaking clients. Fees are stated openly at $199 per half-hour after an introductory 15-minute intake, and service areas include Brampton, Oakville, Milton and Toronto.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('hansra-law-toronto','Hansra Law','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,4.9,34,43.6558668,-79.3819145,'{"name":"Hansra Law","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Business Law"],"caseTypes":["business"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6558668,"lng":-79.3819145,"address":"1 Dundas St W Suite 2500, Toronto, ON M5G 1Z3","phone":"+14165800345","rating":4.9,"count":34,"slug":"hansra-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Hansra+Law+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1+Dundas+St+W+Suite+2500%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5G+1Z3","website":"https://www.hansralaw.ca","blurb":"Business Law in Toronto. Rated 4.9 from 34 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/hansra-law-toronto.webp"}','{"1":[["09:00","18:00"]],"2":[["09:00","18:00"]],"3":[["09:00","18:00"]],"4":[["09:00","18:00"]],"5":[["09:00","18:00"]]}','Hansra Law is a Toronto business firm acting on incorporations, business sales and purchases, franchise agreements and commercial contracts.

The firm is led by Sukhi Hansra, a business and franchise lawyer who describes himself as a four-time entrepreneur with a background in restaurants, technology and AI. Daniel Rizzi is listed as senior corporate lawyer, working on corporate and commercial law, business sales and acquisitions, and technology and SaaS matters. Its approach, which it calls business first, legal second, gives clients the scope, risks and cost in writing before they proceed. It handles Ontario matters for clients across Canada and abroad.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('pelsmakher-law-toronto','Pelsmakher Law','Toronto','ON','toronto',0,5,33,43.6547091,-79.3598465,'{"name":"Pelsmakher Law","city":"Toronto","featured":false,"tags":["Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["employment"],"region":"toronto","province":"ON","lat":43.6547091,"lng":-79.3598465,"address":"507 King St E, Toronto, ON M5A 1M3","phone":"+16479920296","rating":5,"count":33,"slug":"pelsmakher-law-toronto","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Pelsmakher+Law+Toronto+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=507+King+St+E%2C+Toronto%2C+ON+M5A+1M3","website":"https://www.pelslaw.ca","blurb":"Employment Law in Toronto. Rated 5.0 from 33 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/pelsmakher-law-toronto.png"}',NULL,'Pelsmakher Law is a Toronto employment and labour firm acting for employees and employers on dismissal, human rights and contract matters.

Founder Simon Pelsmakher also advises on executive compensation, privacy, occupational health and safety, and pensions and benefits. For employees, the site lists severance assessment and negotiation, employment contract analysis, employment standards issues such as unpaid wages and overtime, pregnancy and parental leave, and termination rules for federally regulated employees under the Canada Labour Code. For employers it describes help managing workplace risk and policies. The firm says acting for both sides shapes its strategy, and that clients deal directly with their lawyer.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('robert-legal-montreal','Robert Légal','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.9,33,45.5043685,-73.5576354,'{"name":"Robert Légal","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["criminal","litigation"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.5043685,"lng":-73.5576354,"address":"500 Place d''Armes Ste 2350, Montreal, Quebec H2Y 2W2","phone":"+15147556378","rating":4.9,"count":33,"slug":"robert-legal-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Robert+L%C3%A9gal+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=500+Place+d%27Armes+Ste+2350%2C+Montreal%2C+Quebec+H2Y+2W2","website":"https://www.robertlegal.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Civil Litigation in Montreal. Rated 4.9 from 33 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/robert-legal-montreal.jpg"}','{"1":[["00:00","23:59"]],"2":[["00:00","23:59"]],"3":[["00:00","23:59"]],"4":[["00:00","23:59"]],"5":[["00:00","23:59"]],"6":[["00:00","23:59"]],"7":[["00:00","23:59"]]}','Robert Légal is a Montreal criminal and penal defence firm founded by Me Anne-Geneviève Robert, a graduate of the Université de Montréal.

In French, the site says the practice is devoted exclusively to criminal and penal defence and represents people charged at every stage, from the police investigation to trial. Files include offences against the person, sexual offences, domestic violence, economic crimes and drug offences. Me Robert sits on the board of the Association des avocats de la défense de Montréal-Longueuil-Laval and writes regularly on the blog of the Jeune Barreau. The firm''s office is on Place d''Armes, and it says its lawyers are reachable at any time.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('one-family-law-edmonton-divorce-law-edmonton','One Family Law Edmonton Divorce Law','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,5,31,53.5511756,-113.5361656,'{"name":"One Family Law Edmonton Divorce Law","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.5511756,"lng":-113.5361656,"address":"10706 124 St Ste 205, Edmonton, AB T5M 0H1","phone":"+17809155735","rating":5,"count":31,"slug":"one-family-law-edmonton-divorce-law-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/One+Family+Law+Edmonton+Divorce+Law+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10706+124+St+Ste+205%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T5M+0H1","website":"https://www.onefamily.law","blurb":"Family Law in Edmonton. Rated 5.0 from 31 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/one-family-law-edmonton-divorce-law-edmonton.png"}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','One Family Law is an Edmonton family firm that helps separating couples reach a flat-fee separation agreement through one shared, neutral lawyer.

Founder Melissa Bourgeois created what the firm calls the One Lawyer Divorce Method, in which a single lawyer advises both spouses instead of each hiring opposing counsel. According to the site, the model followed a two-year regulatory process and an 18-month pilot. The firm describes a seven-step process that takes most clients from first meeting to signed agreement in six to eight weeks, and it also handles uncontested divorce in Alberta. The team page names Cody Dub and Ashley Goodnough alongside Melissa Bourgeois.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('chinook-law-calgary','Chinook Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,5,30,51.076332,-114.0067966,'{"name":"Chinook Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.076332,"lng":-114.0067966,"address":"2750 22 St NE #208, Calgary, AB T2E 7L9","phone":"+15873553168","rating":5,"count":30,"slug":"chinook-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Chinook+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2750+22+St+NE+%23208%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2E+7L9","website":"https://chinook.law","blurb":"Personal Injury in Calgary. Rated 5.0 from 30 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/chinook-law-calgary.webp"}',NULL,'Chinook Law is a Calgary firm whose practice is limited to personal injury litigation arising from motor vehicle accidents in Alberta.

The site says car accident injury cases are the only area of law it handles. It lists injured drivers, vehicle passengers, motorcyclists, cyclists, pedestrians, transit riders, and ride share and taxi passengers. Compensation categories it describes include pain and suffering, loss of income and earning opportunity, out-of-pocket and housekeeping expenses, and medical costs. The firm says it keeps a limited case load, follows a digital-first policy and works on a contingency basis, so nothing is owed if no funds are recovered.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('mtl-avocat-inc-montreal','MTL Avocat Inc.','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,5,30,45.5029902,-73.5560243,'{"name":"MTL Avocat Inc.","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration"],"caseTypes":["immigration"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.5029902,"lng":-73.5560243,"address":"204 Rue du St.-Sacrement #300, Montreal, Quebec H2Y 2S9","phone":"+15144182636","rating":5,"count":30,"slug":"mtl-avocat-inc-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/MTL+Avocat+Inc.+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=204+Rue+du+St.-Sacrement+%23300%2C+Montreal%2C+Quebec+H2Y+2S9","website":"https://www.mtl-avocats.ca","blurb":"Immigration in Montreal. Rated 5.0 from 30 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/mtl-avocat-inc-montreal.png"}',NULL,'MTL Avocat Inc., also known as Mehdi Tenouri Legal, is a Montreal firm handling immigration to Canada and business law for individuals and companies.

In French, the site lists permanent residence, investor files, study permits and work permits on the immigration side, and incorporation, shareholder disputes, commercial disputes, dissolution, bankruptcy and insolvency on the business side. It also offers guidance on cybersecurity and cybercrime for small businesses. Me Mehdi Tenouri practised for 12 years in France and taught business and banking law at the Paris bar school. He is an accredited small claims mediator, and the firm has offices in Montreal and the Montérégie.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('nicola-circelli-law-london','Nicola Circelli Law','London','ON','southwestern',0,5,30,42.9884706,-81.2550018,'{"name":"Nicola Circelli Law","city":"London","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence","Wills & Estates","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["criminal","wills","litigation"],"region":"southwestern","province":"ON","lat":42.9884706,"lng":-81.2550018,"address":"585 Talbot St, London, ON N6A 2T2","phone":"+15196019977","rating":5,"count":30,"slug":"nicola-circelli-law-london","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Nicola+Circelli+Law+London+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=585+Talbot+St%2C+London%2C+ON+N6A+2T2","website":"https://nicolacircellilaw.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence / Wills & Estates in London. Rated 5.0 from 30 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/nicola-circelli-law-london.webp"}',NULL,'Nicola Circelli Law is a London, Ontario criminal defence practice handling impaired driving, assault, drug and fraud charges.

Nicola Circelli was called to the Ontario bar in 2016 after articling with Circelli Law. Her site notes a history degree from McGill, a law degree from the University of Leicester, and a master''s in international human rights law from the National University of Ireland, Galway. Practice areas also include weapons offences, bail hearings, mental health law, hearings for people found not criminally responsible, and the Consent and Capacity Board. The firm says it takes urgent matters at any hour and that impaired driving cases involve licence suspensions, impoundment and mandatory minimum penalties.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('haxell-law-oakville','Haxell Law','Oakville','ON','peel-halton',0,4.8,31,43.4719239,-79.6652489,'{"name":"Haxell Law","city":"Oakville","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.4719239,"lng":-79.6652489,"address":"1276 Cornwall Rd C, Oakville, ON L6J 7W5","phone":"+19058450767","rating":4.8,"count":31,"slug":"haxell-law-oakville","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Haxell+Law+Oakville+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1276+Cornwall+Rd+C%2C+Oakville%2C+ON+L6J+7W5","website":"https://www.haxelllaw.com","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Oakville. Rated 4.8 from 31 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/haxell-law-oakville.jpg"}',NULL,'Haxell Law is an Oakville firm handling real estate transactions, wills, powers of attorney, probate applications and estate planning, with notary services.

According to its website, the firm has served the Oakville community since 1993 and sits close to the QEW. Its lawyer Jameson Glas, who grew up in Oakville, holds a Juris Doctor from the University of Toronto, was called to the Ontario bar in 2014, and earlier practised civil litigation in Toronto with a focus on real estate, private loans and employment. The site describes the practice as barrister, solicitor and notary public work for clients in Oakville and the surrounding area.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('maana-law-mississauga','Maana Law','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,4.9,29,43.6181961,-79.6732124,'{"name":"Maana Law","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["injury","litigation"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6181961,"lng":-79.6732124,"address":"90 Matheson Blvd W Ste 101, Mississauga, ON L5R 3R3","phone":"+14379794878","rating":4.9,"count":29,"slug":"maana-law-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Maana+Law+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=90+Matheson+Blvd+W+Ste+101%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L5R+3R3","website":"https://www.maanalaw.com","blurb":"Personal Injury / Civil Litigation in Mississauga. Rated 4.9 from 29 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/maana-law-mississauga.png"}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Maana Law is a Mississauga personal injury firm handling car accidents, slip and falls, pedestrian and motorcycle injuries.

The firm says it has more than ten years of experience and names Aman Kalra as its lead lawyer. Its practice list also covers catastrophic accidents, dog bites, public transit accidents, soft tissue and chronic pain, and long-term disability matters. Meetings can be held virtually, and the site mentions home or hospital visits. It works on a contingency fee basis according to its pages, and lists neighbourhoods served such as Erin Mills, Cooksville, Churchill Meadows, Meadowvale and City Centre.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lions-gate-law-corporation-vancouver','Lions Gate Law Corporation','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,5,28,49.286722,-123.1252665,'{"name":"Lions Gate Law Corporation","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["wills"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.286722,"lng":-123.1252665,"address":"1188 W Georgia St #950, Vancouver, BC V6E 4A2","phone":"+16046870023","rating":5,"count":28,"slug":"lions-gate-law-corporation-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Lions+Gate+Law+Corporation+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1188+W+Georgia+St+%23950%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V6E+4A2","website":"https://lionsgatelaw.com","blurb":"Wills & Estates in Vancouver. Rated 5.0 from 28 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lions-gate-law-corporation-vancouver.png"}',NULL,'Lions Gate Law Corporation is a Vancouver firm handling real estate conveyancing, mortgage refinances, incorporations, and wills and estates.

Its website lists commercial conveyancing and mortgage refinances among its services and describes its lawyers as mobile. The firm''s office is on West Georgia Street in downtown Vancouver, and its lawyer profiles cite degrees from the University of British Columbia, the London School of Economics and McGill University.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('s-athwal-law-professional-corporation-mississauga','S. Athwal Law Professional Corporation','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,5,28,43.6597924,-79.6010213,'{"name":"S. Athwal Law Professional Corporation","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6597924,"lng":-79.6010213,"address":"2601 Matheson Blvd E Ste 38, Mississauga, ON L4W 5A8","phone":"+12895011851","rating":5,"count":28,"slug":"s-athwal-law-professional-corporation-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/S.+Athwal+Law+Professional+Corporation+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2601+Matheson+Blvd+E+Ste+38%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L4W+5A8","website":"https://athwallaw.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Mississauga. Rated 5.0 from 28 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/s-athwal-law-professional-corporation-mississauga.png"}','{"1":[["00:00","23:59"]],"2":[["00:00","23:59"]],"3":[["00:00","23:59"]],"4":[["00:00","23:59"]],"5":[["00:00","23:59"]],"6":[["00:00","23:59"]],"7":[["00:00","23:59"]]}','S.Athwal Law is a Mississauga criminal defence practice handling assault, impaired driving, sexual offence and weapons charges.

Sahej Athwal holds a Master of Laws from Osgoode Hall Law School and belongs to the Law Society of Ontario and the Criminal Lawyers'' Association. His site says he appears at trial in the Ontario Court of Justice and the Superior Court of Justice and works in English, Hindi, Punjabi and Urdu. Practice areas also include drug offences, bail, property offences and youth criminal justice. Service areas listed include Toronto, Brampton, Vaughan, North York, Richmond Hill, Newmarket and Markham, and the firm says it is available around the clock.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('avocat-criminel-montreal-montreal','Avocat Criminel Montréal','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,4.8,29,45.5052109,-73.5536422,'{"name":"Avocat Criminel Montréal","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.5052109,"lng":-73.5536422,"address":"20 Rue St-Paul Ouest Bureau 203, Montreal, Quebec H2Y 1Y6","phone":"+15147005212","rating":4.8,"count":29,"slug":"avocat-criminel-montreal-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Avocat+Criminel+Montr%C3%A9al+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=20+Rue+St-Paul+Ouest+Bureau+203%2C+Montreal%2C+Quebec+H2Y+1Y6","website":"https://avocatcriminelmtl.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Montreal. Rated 4.8 from 29 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/avocat-criminel-montreal-montreal.png"}',NULL,'Lespérance Avocats, listed as Avocat Criminel Montréal, is a criminal defence firm serving Montreal, Laval, Gatineau and Maniwaki in French and English.

Its site places the main office in Old Montreal near Notre-Dame Basilica, with a second office in Gatineau and meetings in Maniwaki by appointment. The firm acts in criminal cases involving firearms, drugs, violence and domestic violence, and its pages explain offences tied to sexual services and human trafficking. It says it accepts legal aid and describes a collaborative, structured approach to each file, supported by an administrative team that manages communication and case handling.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('mcelroy-law-ottawa','McElroy Law','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.9,27,45.4178355,-75.6907736,'{"name":"McElroy Law","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4178355,"lng":-75.6907736,"address":"185 Somerset St W #305, Ottawa, ON K2P 1L9","phone":"+16134215058","rating":4.9,"count":27,"slug":"mcelroy-law-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/McElroy+Law+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=185+Somerset+St+W+%23305%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K2P+1L9","website":"https://www.mcelroylaw.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Ottawa. Rated 4.9 from 27 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/mcelroy-law-ottawa.webp"}',NULL,'McElroy Law is an Ottawa criminal defence firm acting for people charged with offences, from bail hearings through trials and appeals.

Anne-Marie McElroy founded the firm in 2015, and associate Dawn Dickinson has since joined. Anne-Marie graduated from the University of Ottawa law school in 2009, was called to the bar in 2010 and has practised criminal law exclusively since. Her experience includes impaired driving, assault, theft and sexual offences. Outside the firm she supervises Pro Bono Students Canada projects, sits on the board of Circles of Support and Accountability, has taught first-year criminal law at the University of Ottawa, and mentors women in criminal defence. The firm also runs a blog on new cases and legislation.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lydia-h-thomson-law-corporation-kelowna','Lydia H. Thomson Law Corporation','Kelowna','BC','bc-okanagan',0,4.7,28,49.8802815,-119.4612693,'{"name":"Lydia H. Thomson Law Corporation","city":"Kelowna","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["family","realestate","wills"],"region":"bc-okanagan","province":"BC","lat":49.8802815,"lng":-119.4612693,"address":"1631 Dickson Ave #540, Kelowna, BC V1Y 0B5","phone":"+12507170711","rating":4.7,"count":28,"slug":"lydia-h-thomson-law-corporation-kelowna","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Lydia+H.+Thomson+Law+Corporation+Kelowna+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1631+Dickson+Ave+%23540%2C+Kelowna%2C+BC+V1Y+0B5","website":"https://www.lydiathomsonlaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law / Real Estate in Kelowna. Rated 4.7 from 28 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lydia-h-thomson-law-corporation-kelowna.png"}',NULL,'Thomson Law is a small Kelowna firm centred on family law and family mediation, serving Kelowna, West Kelowna and Lake Country.

Lydia Thomson, whose practice operates as Lydia H. Thomson Law Corporation, opened the firm in the summer of 2007 after years at a local firm. She graduated from the University of Saskatchewan College of Law, has practised in Kelowna for 18 years and is accredited by the Law Society of British Columbia as a family law mediator. Other services listed are wills and estates, committeeship and residential conveyancing, along with help for parents involved with the Ministry. The site names Brandon as another lawyer on the team and says many referrals come from past clients.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('sankoff-criminal-law-edmonton','Sankoff Criminal Law','Edmonton','AB','ab-edmonton',0,5,25,53.5235338,-113.4943152,'{"name":"Sankoff Criminal Law","city":"Edmonton","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"ab-edmonton","province":"AB","lat":53.5235338,"lng":-113.4943152,"address":"10171 Saskatchewan Dr NW Unit 414, Edmonton, AB T6E 6K3","phone":"+15873379133","rating":5,"count":25,"slug":"sankoff-criminal-law-edmonton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Sankoff+Criminal+Law+Edmonton+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=10171+Saskatchewan+Dr+NW+Unit+414%2C+Edmonton%2C+AB+T6E+6K3","website":"https://sankoffcriminallaw.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Edmonton. Rated 5.0 from 25 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/sankoff-criminal-law-edmonton.jpg"}',NULL,'Sankoff Criminal Law is a boutique Edmonton criminal firm that handles complex trials and appeals for clients and supports other defence lawyers.

The site lists criminal trials, criminal appeals, leave applications, jury charge analysis and consulting for lawyers, including preparing legal applications and strategic advice. Charges it names include sexual assault, murder, fraud and theft, regulatory offences, drug offences, firearms offences, serious violent offences and youth criminal justice matters. Peter Sankoff is described as a lawyer other criminal counsel turn to on difficult points of evidence and appellate strategy. Steven Penney is Professor in Residence, assisting with research, and the team includes student lawyers.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('holmes-stephen-a-brampton','Holmes Stephen A','Brampton','ON','peel-halton',0,4.8,26,43.6815662,-79.7646979,'{"name":"Holmes Stephen A","city":"Brampton","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.6815662,"lng":-79.7646979,"address":"180 Queen, Brampton, ON L6X 1A8","phone":"+19057963030","rating":4.8,"count":26,"slug":"holmes-stephen-a-brampton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Holmes+Stephen+A+Brampton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=180+Queen%2C+Brampton%2C+ON+L6X+1A8","website":"https://www.stephenholmeslawoffice.com","blurb":"Real Estate in Brampton. Rated 4.8 from 26 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/holmes-stephen-a-brampton.png"}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]],"6":[["09:00","17:00"]],"7":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Stephen Holmes Law Office is a Brampton practice offering real estate, wills and estates, and business law in Peel, Halton and the GTA.

Listed in directories as Holmes Stephen A, its website states that the lawyer has 20 years of experience with residential purchases, sales and refinances, and 30 years in commercial real estate. Real estate is the first area on the site, followed by wills and estates and business law.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('jason-wuttunee-criminal-defence-lawyer-calgary','Jason Wuttunee Criminal Defence Lawyer','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,4.7,26,51.0466733,-114.0757746,'{"name":"Jason Wuttunee Criminal Defence Lawyer","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0466733,"lng":-114.0757746,"address":"645 7 Ave SW #2650, Calgary, AB T2P 4G8","phone":"+15876020970","rating":4.7,"count":26,"slug":"jason-wuttunee-criminal-defence-lawyer-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Jason+Wuttunee+Criminal+Defence+Lawyer+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=645+7+Ave+SW+%232650%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2P+4G8","website":"https://jwcriminaldefence.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Calgary. Rated 4.7 from 26 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/jason-wuttunee-criminal-defence-lawyer-calgary.png"}',NULL,'Jason Wuttunee is a Calgary criminal defence lawyer who represents people accused of homicide, drug offences, impaired driving and financial crimes.

Before opening his defence practice he spent eleven years as a Crown Prosecutor with Alberta Justice, handling hundreds of criminal matters including high-profile cases, and acted as appellate counsel before the Alberta Court of Appeal. His site says he practises trial and appellate litigation in all areas of criminal law and in select civil matters. Separate pages cover first and second degree murder and infanticide, and white-collar offences such as embezzlement, tax evasion, securities fraud, money laundering and mortgage fraud.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('brass-law-office-ottawa','Brass Law Office','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,4.7,26,45.4178355,-75.6907736,'{"name":"Brass Law Office","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4178355,"lng":-75.6907736,"address":"185 Somerset St W #204, Ottawa, ON K2P 1L9","phone":"+16132385757","rating":4.7,"count":26,"slug":"brass-law-office-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Brass+Law+Office+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=185+Somerset+St+W+%23204%2C+Ottawa%2C+ON+K2P+1L9","website":"https://www.brasslawoffice.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Ottawa. Rated 4.7 from 26 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/brass-law-office-ottawa.png"}',NULL,'Brass Law Office is an Ottawa criminal defence firm acting for people accused of criminal and quasi-criminal offences.

According to its site, its lawyers have practised for over 25 years. The firm lists murder, assault, mischief, robbery, fraud, sexual offences and driving charges among the allegations it defends. It says it retains outside professionals such as private investigators, DNA analysts, pathologists, toxicologists, blood spatter analysts and forensic accountants to support a case. It also describes seeking remedies for Charter breaches, including unlawful detentions and arrests, unreasonable searches and seizures, and violations of the right to counsel. The firm is on Somerset Street West.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('samy-ziada-avocat-montreal','Samy Ziada Avocat','Montreal','QC','qc-montreal',0,5,24,45.5044461,-73.5576923,'{"name":"Samy Ziada Avocat","city":"Montreal","featured":false,"tags":["Immigration","Civil Litigation","Business Law"],"caseTypes":["immigration","litigation","business"],"region":"qc-montreal","province":"QC","lat":45.5044461,"lng":-73.5576923,"address":"500 Place d''Armes, Montreal, Quebec H2Y 2W2","phone":"+14387388678","rating":5,"count":24,"slug":"samy-ziada-avocat-montreal","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Samy+Ziada+Avocat+Montreal+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=500+Place+d%27Armes%2C+Montreal%2C+Quebec+H2Y+2W2","website":"https://www.zsavocats.com","blurb":"Immigration / Civil Litigation in Montreal. Rated 5.0 from 24 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/samy-ziada-avocat-montreal.png"}','{"1":[["09:00","20:00"]],"2":[["09:00","20:00"]],"3":[["09:00","20:00"]],"4":[["09:00","20:00"]],"5":[["09:00","20:00"]],"6":[["09:00","20:00"]],"7":[["09:00","20:00"]]}','Samy Ziada Avocat, also presented as ZS Avocats, is a Montreal practice handling civil and commercial litigation, immigration and business law.

In French, Me Samy Ziada, a member of the Barreau du Québec, says he is one of the few Montreal lawyers combining immigration with civil and commercial litigation. Litigation work spans housing, employment, real estate and insurance disputes. Immigration files include sponsorship, asylum claims and temporary or permanent residence. The firm serves Montréal, Laval and the Rive-Nord and Rive-Sud, with an office on Place d''Armes, and meetings can be held in person or online.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('kraska-law-mississauga','Kraska Law','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,4.8,25,43.5998268,-79.6402613,'{"name":"Kraska Law","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.5998268,"lng":-79.6402613,"address":"4310 Sherwoodtowne Blvd #102, Mississauga, ON L4Z 2G6","phone":"+14165545442","rating":4.8,"count":25,"slug":"kraska-law-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Kraska+Law+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=4310+Sherwoodtowne+Blvd+%23102%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L4Z+2G6","website":"https://kraskalaw.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Mississauga. Rated 4.8 from 25 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/kraska-law-mississauga.jpg"}',NULL,'Kraska Law is a Mississauga criminal defence firm led by Robert S. Kraska, a former federal prosecutor, offering criminal defence, criminal appeals and notary services.

According to its website, Robert Kraska worked with the Public Prosecution Service of Canada before focusing his practice on criminal law, and the firm cites over 40 years of combined defence and prosecution experience. Charges named range from assault, impaired driving and theft to large frauds and traffic offences. Other services include wills, independent legal advice, record suspension applications, victim compensation applications and civil litigation. Services are offered in English and Polish, and the firm says it is available for bail hearings at all hours.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('iqbal-law-professional-corporation-mississauga','Iqbal Law Professional Corporation','Mississauga','ON','peel-halton',0,5,23,43.600829,-79.641196,'{"name":"Iqbal Law Professional Corporation","city":"Mississauga","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.600829,"lng":-79.641196,"address":"55 Village Centre Pl #200, Mississauga, ON L4Z 1V9","phone":"+12896520529","rating":5,"count":23,"slug":"iqbal-law-professional-corporation-mississauga","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Iqbal+Law+Professional+Corporation+Mississauga+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=55+Village+Centre+Pl+%23200%2C+Mississauga%2C+ON+L4Z+1V9","website":"https://iqbalslaw.com","blurb":"Family Law in Mississauga. Rated 5.0 from 23 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/iqbal-law-professional-corporation-mississauga.webp"}',NULL,'Iqbal Law is a Mississauga family law practice led by Nasar Iqbal, handling divorce, custody, support and property division across the GTA.

Nasar Iqbal works as a sole practitioner after earlier work with downtown firms and the Ministry of the Attorney General, according to the site. He speaks English, Urdu, Punjabi and Hindi and appears at all levels of Ontario courts. The firm lists clients in Oakville, Hamilton, Newmarket, Oshawa, Barrie, Kitchener, Woodstock, Sarnia and London, and also offers unbundled services for self-represented people. Its pages cover high-value asset division, parenting disputes and a family law blog.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('kedgeanchor-law-calgary','KedgeAnchor Law','Calgary','AB','ab-calgary',0,5,22,51.0473612,-114.0846058,'{"name":"KedgeAnchor Law","city":"Calgary","featured":false,"tags":["Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["employment"],"region":"ab-calgary","province":"AB","lat":51.0473612,"lng":-114.0846058,"address":"1000 7 Ave SW #900, Calgary, AB T2P 5L5","phone":"+15873169777","rating":5,"count":22,"slug":"kedgeanchor-law-calgary","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/KedgeAnchor+Law+Calgary+Alberta","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1000+7+Ave+SW+%23900%2C+Calgary%2C+AB+T2P+5L5","website":"https://kedgeanchorlaw.ca","blurb":"Employment Law in Calgary. Rated 5.0 from 22 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/kedgeanchor-law-calgary.png"}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','KedgeAnchor Law is a Calgary firm handling employment law and workplace disputes, plus corporate, family, real estate and estate matters.

The site describes more than 23 years of practice across the United Kingdom, Nigeria and Canada, and presents Christie Eze as the lawyer behind the firm. Its employment page covers severance, wrongful dismissal and workplace rights for Alberta professionals and employers. The firm calls itself a modern law collective and lists corporate and commercial advisory, family law and separation planning, real estate transactions, estate planning and administration, civil litigation and immigration among its practice areas.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('grayer-law-office-family-lawyer-vancouver','Grayer Law Office (Family Lawyer','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.8,22,49.2718395,-123.0693101,'{"name":"Grayer Law Office (Family Lawyer","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Business Law"],"caseTypes":["family","business"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2718395,"lng":-123.0693101,"address":"1416 Commercial Dr #101, Vancouver, BC V5L 3X9","phone":"+16046282241","rating":4.8,"count":22,"slug":"grayer-law-office-family-lawyer-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Grayer+Law+Office+%28Family+Lawyer+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1416+Commercial+Dr+%23101%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V5L+3X9","website":"https://www.grayerlaw.com","blurb":"Family Law / Business Law in Vancouver. Rated 4.8 from 22 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/grayer-law-office-family-lawyer-vancouver.webp"}',NULL,'Grayer Law Office is an East Vancouver family law firm on Commercial Drive offering family mediation, collaborative law, negotiation and litigation.

Its website says the aim is to settle cohabitation, separation and divorce issues with as little conflict and expense as possible, including parenting and children, property division, and child and spousal support. Patrick is described as a fully trained and accredited family mediator and a member of the Mediate BC Roster. The site explains mediation as a process where the participants shape the outcome rather than a court, with or without lawyers present.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('van-looyen-and-fallon-law-professional-corporation-hamilton','Van Looyen and Fallon Law Professional Corporation','Hamilton','ON','hamilton-niagara',0,4.8,22,43.2553707,-79.8710712,'{"name":"Van Looyen and Fallon Law Professional Corporation","city":"Hamilton","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Civil Litigation"],"caseTypes":["family","litigation"],"region":"hamilton-niagara","province":"ON","lat":43.2553707,"lng":-79.8710712,"address":"25 Main St W Suite 601, Hamilton, ON L8N 1E8","phone":"+13653249370","rating":4.8,"count":22,"slug":"van-looyen-and-fallon-law-professional-corporation-hamilton","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Van+Looyen+and+Fallon+Law+Professional+Corporation+Hamilton+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=25+Main+St+W+Suite+601%2C+Hamilton%2C+ON+L8N+1E8","website":"https://www.vanlooyenandfallon.com","blurb":"Family Law / Civil Litigation in Hamilton. Rated 4.8 from 22 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/van-looyen-and-fallon-law-professional-corporation-hamilton.webp"}',NULL,'Van Looyen and Fallon is a Hamilton family law firm that also serves Brantford and surrounding areas, practising family law exclusively.

The firm is run by a wife and husband team, Emily Van Looyen and Patrick Fallon. Emily has practised family law for eight years and appears in the Ontario Court of Justice, the Superior Court of Justice and Unified Family Courts. She is a trained Collaborative Practice professional, acts as an agent for the Office of the Children''s Lawyer, supervises for Pro Bono Students Canada and sits on the board of a Hamilton community agency. The team also includes a legal assistant and a law clerk, and the firm describes an organized, personal approach to each matter.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('ebpc-personal-injury-lawyer-ottawa','EBPC Personal Injury Lawyer','Ottawa','ON','eastern',0,5,21,45.4561856,-75.5844856,'{"name":"EBPC Personal Injury Lawyer","city":"Ottawa","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"eastern","province":"ON","lat":45.4561856,"lng":-75.5844856,"address":"1010 Polytek St Unit 2, Gloucester, ON K1J 9H8","phone":"+18888444763","rating":5,"count":21,"slug":"ebpc-personal-injury-lawyer-ottawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/EBPC+Personal+Injury+Lawyer+Ottawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=1010+Polytek+St+Unit+2%2C+Gloucester%2C+ON+K1J+9H8","website":"https://ebpclaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in Ottawa. Rated 5.0 from 21 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/ebpc-personal-injury-lawyer-ottawa.png"}',NULL,'EBPC Personal Injury Lawyer is a personal injury firm with an Ottawa-area office in Gloucester, also serving Fergus, London and Belleville.

The firm describes itself as a member of the Barapp Law Alliance and lists car accidents, orthopaedic injuries, slip and fall, motorcycle and public transit cases. Lorne Weinstock holds a psychology degree from York University and a law degree from Windsor, and was admitted to the Law Society of Upper Canada in 2002. His site says he handles spinal and brain injuries from motor vehicle accidents and occupiers'' liability cases. Fees are payable only if the case succeeds, according to the firm.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('goldwyn-law-professional-corporation-markham','Goldwyn Law Professional Corporation','Markham','ON','york-durham',0,5,21,43.818985,-79.3487467,'{"name":"Goldwyn Law Professional Corporation","city":"Markham","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate"],"caseTypes":["realestate"],"region":"york-durham","province":"ON","lat":43.818985,"lng":-79.3487467,"address":"7225 Woodbine Ave #1, Markham, ON L3R 1A3","phone":"+14168932723","rating":5,"count":21,"slug":"goldwyn-law-professional-corporation-markham","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Goldwyn+Law+Professional+Corporation+Markham+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=7225+Woodbine+Ave+%231%2C+Markham%2C+ON+L3R+1A3","website":"https://www.goldwynlaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate in Markham. Rated 5.0 from 21 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/goldwyn-law-professional-corporation-markham.png"}',NULL,'Goldwyn Law is a Markham firm handling real estate, corporate and commercial, secured lending, wills and estates, and mortgage enforcement.

The website describes residential and commercial real estate closings, incorporations and start-up planning, financial services and secured lending transactions, and estate planning. It also addresses mortgage defaults from both the borrower and the lender side. Notary services for affidavits and statutory declarations are listed, in person or virtually. The firm says it acts across Ontario and describes its mission as being a friendly and practical presence for first-time homebuyers, investors and entrepreneurs.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('muldoon-and-company-vancouver','Muldoon & Company','Vancouver','BC','bc-vancouver',0,4.8,21,49.2874901,-123.1170948,'{"name":"Muldoon & Company","city":"Vancouver","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"bc-vancouver","province":"BC","lat":49.2874901,"lng":-123.1170948,"address":"355 Burrard St #1205, Vancouver, BC V6C 2G8","phone":"+16049749749","rating":4.8,"count":21,"slug":"muldoon-and-company-vancouver","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Muldoon+%26+Company+Vancouver+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=355+Burrard+St+%231205%2C+Vancouver%2C+BC+V6C+2G8","website":"https://www.muldoonandcompany.com","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Vancouver. Rated 4.8 from 21 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/muldoon-and-company-vancouver.png"}',NULL,'Muldoon & Company are Vancouver trial lawyers handling criminal law, impaired driving, drug charges and personal injury.

The offices are in the historic Marine Building. Don Muldoon has practised since 1981. In 1982 he and Michael Bolton started the criminal firm Bolton & Muldoon, and the site says that tradition continues. Listed work includes drug possession, trafficking and production, assault including spousal and sexual assault, Immediate Roadside Prohibitions and Administrative Driving Prohibitions. The firm is based in downtown Vancouver but says it handles cases throughout British Columbia, and it names a civil forfeiture matter among its recent cases.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('snow-lawyers-professional-corporation-london','Snow Lawyers Professional Corporation','London','ON','southwestern',0,5,20,42.9882996,-81.2533049,'{"name":"Snow Lawyers Professional Corporation","city":"London","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"southwestern","province":"ON","lat":42.9882996,"lng":-81.2533049,"address":"135 Albert St, London, ON N6A 1L9","phone":"+15194347669","rating":5,"count":20,"slug":"snow-lawyers-professional-corporation-london","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Snow+Lawyers+Professional+Corporation+London+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=135+Albert+St%2C+London%2C+ON+N6A+1L9","website":"https://snowlawyers.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in London. Rated 5.0 from 20 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/snow-lawyers-professional-corporation-london.png"}',NULL,'Snow Lawyers is a London trial law firm defending impaired driving, drug, weapons and assault charges across southwestern Ontario.

The firm, which its structured data dates to 2019, lists over 80, guns and weapons, domestic assault and sexual assault among its services. Geoff Snow focuses on complex trials and applications in the Ontario Court of Justice and the Superior Court of Justice, and holds a Master of Laws in criminal law and procedure. The team page also names Danielle D''Alonzo and Delia Matias. The site says the firm keeps clients'' privacy in mind and prepares for trials that last from hours to months.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lakeshore-law-oakville','Lakeshore Law','Oakville','ON','peel-halton',0,5,20,43.4472434,-79.6668841,'{"name":"Lakeshore Law","city":"Oakville","featured":false,"tags":["Business Law"],"caseTypes":["business"],"region":"peel-halton","province":"ON","lat":43.4472434,"lng":-79.6668841,"address":"277 Lakeshore Rd E #408, Oakville, ON L6J 6J3","phone":"+16479827714","rating":5,"count":20,"slug":"lakeshore-law-oakville","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Lakeshore+Law+Oakville+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=277+Lakeshore+Rd+E+%23408%2C+Oakville%2C+ON+L6J+6J3","website":"https://lakeshore.law","blurb":"Business Law in Oakville. Rated 5.0 from 20 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lakeshore-law-oakville.png"}',NULL,'Lakeshore Law is an Oakville firm covering corporate and commercial law, construction, criminal, family and civil litigation, and immigration matters.

Arjun Sekhon graduated from the University of Windsor in 2021 and was called to the Ontario bar in 2022; his site lists corporate, commercial, criminal, family and immigration work. Daniel Ibrahim, of counsel, practises litigation before the Ontario Court of Justice and Superior Court of Justice, with municipal, criminal, family and civil work, plus probate applications, wills and powers of attorney. The firm says its team has backgrounds in larger firms and in-house roles, and that it takes on pro bono work and mentorship.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('fox-mcnevin-mackay-llp-lawyers-windsor','Fox McNevin MacKay LLP Lawyers','Windsor','ON','southwestern',0,4.8,20,42.28762,-83.0205065,'{"name":"Fox McNevin MacKay LLP Lawyers","city":"Windsor","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"southwestern","province":"ON","lat":42.28762,"lng":-83.0205065,"address":"2485 Ouellette Ave Ste 104, Windsor, ON N8X 1L5","phone":"+15192591820","rating":4.8,"count":20,"slug":"fox-mcnevin-mackay-llp-lawyers-windsor","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Fox+McNevin+MacKay+LLP+Lawyers+Windsor+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=2485+Ouellette+Ave+Ste+104%2C+Windsor%2C+ON+N8X+1L5","website":"https://www.foxmcnevinmackay.com","blurb":"Family Law in Windsor. Rated 4.8 from 20 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/fox-mcnevin-mackay-llp-lawyers-windsor.webp"}',NULL,'Fox McNevin MacKay LLP is a Windsor family law firm handling divorce, separation, property division, custody, access and support.

Its services include collaborative family law, marriage, separation and cohabitation agreements, uncontested divorce, mediation and arbitration, litigation and appeals. Tanya McNevin earned her law degree from the University of Windsor in 2010, was called to the Ontario bar in 2011 and spent ten years in the legal field beforehand. Thomas MacKay and Mary Fox are also named on the team page. The firm says it develops a custom strategy with each client and uses mediation, collaborative processes and litigation.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('edh-law-peterborough','EDH Law','Peterborough','ON','simcoe-central',0,4.7,144,44.3004849,-78.3215171,'{"name":"EDH Law","city":"Peterborough","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"simcoe-central","province":"ON","lat":44.3004849,"lng":-78.3215171,"address":"195 Sherbrooke St, Peterborough, ON K9J 2N2","phone":"+17057483012","rating":4.7,"count":144,"slug":"edh-law-peterborough","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/EDH+Law+Peterborough+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=195+Sherbrooke+St%2C+Peterborough%2C+ON+K9J+2N2","website":"https://edhlaw.ca","blurb":"Law firm in Peterborough. Rated 4.7 from 144 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/edh-law-peterborough.png"}',NULL,'EDH Law is a general practice in Peterborough and Bradford covering real estate, wills, family, immigration and corporate law.

Formally Evans de Vries Higgins LLP, the firm is the successor to Evans & Evans, established in Bradford in 1894, and to the Peterborough practice of Douglas F. Walker, which has served the Kawarthas since 1974. Robert Evans, Jenivieve de Vries and Nathan Higgins merged their practices in April 2015, and Robert Evans retired at the end of 2019. The site says the firm acts for buyers and sellers in mortgage and title matters, offers notarizing and commissioning, and holds original wills and powers of attorney prepared by lawyers of both earlier practices.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('lamprey-law-professional-corporation-barrie','Lamprey Law Professional Corporation','Barrie','ON','simcoe-central',0,4.9,110,44.3945609,-79.6949704,'{"name":"Lamprey Law Professional Corporation","city":"Barrie","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills"],"region":"simcoe-central","province":"ON","lat":44.3945609,"lng":-79.6949704,"address":"174 Bayfield St, Barrie, ON L4M 3B5","phone":"+17057221114","rating":4.9,"count":110,"slug":"lamprey-law-professional-corporation-barrie","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Lamprey+Law+Professional+Corporation+Barrie+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=174+Bayfield+St%2C+Barrie%2C+ON+L4M+3B5","website":"https://lampreylaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Barrie. Rated 4.9 from 110 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/lamprey-law-professional-corporation-barrie.png"}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Lamprey Law is a Barrie firm handling real estate, mortgages, wills, powers of attorney and estate administration for clients in Barrie and Simcoe County.

Peter Lamprey graduated from Osgoode Hall Law School in 1979, began practising in 1981 and has worked exclusively in the Barrie area since. Jenna Goorts, an Osgoode graduate of 2017 who first worked at the firm as a summer student, practises real estate and wills and estates, and serves on a Simcoe County board for MADD Canada. After years in an early twentieth-century house on Worsley Street, the firm moved to Bayfield Street, where it says the office has parking and is wheelchair accessible.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('cootauco-law-office-st-catharines','Cootauco Law Office','St. Catharines','ON','hamilton-niagara',0,4.9,109,43.1600375,-79.2465686,'{"name":"Cootauco Law Office","city":"St. Catharines","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"hamilton-niagara","province":"ON","lat":43.1600375,"lng":-79.2465686,"address":"110 James St #206, St. Catharines, ON L2R 7E8","phone":"+12268848114","rating":4.9,"count":109,"slug":"cootauco-law-office-st-catharines","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Cootauco+Law+Office+St.+Catharines+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=110+James+St+%23206%2C+St.+Catharines%2C+ON+L2R+7E8","website":"https://www.cootauco.com","blurb":"Family Law in St. Catharines. Rated 4.9 from 109 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/cootauco-law-office-st-catharines.webp"}',NULL,'Cootauco Law Office is a Niagara family law firm that practises only divorce and family law, from child custody to separation agreements.

The office sits across from the courthouse in St. Catharines and also serves Welland and Niagara Falls. Jerzy Cootauco, who holds a J.D. from the University of Windsor and a B.A. from Western University, is empanelled with Legal Aid Ontario to accept certificates for family law and child protection matters. Listed areas include parenting time, child and spousal support, equalization, motions to change, uncontested divorce and foreign divorce opinion letters. The firm says it prefers settlement but litigates when needed, and uses technology to keep costs down.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('bussey-ainsworth-lawyers-peterborough','Bussey Ainsworth Lawyers','Peterborough','ON','simcoe-central',0,5,106,44.295771,-78.3254893,'{"name":"Bussey Ainsworth Lawyers","city":"Peterborough","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills"],"region":"simcoe-central","province":"ON","lat":44.295771,"lng":-78.3254893,"address":"294 Rink St Ste 101, Peterborough, ON K9J 2K2","phone":"+17057490628","rating":5,"count":106,"slug":"bussey-ainsworth-lawyers-peterborough","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Bussey+Ainsworth+Lawyers+Peterborough+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=294+Rink+St+Ste+101%2C+Peterborough%2C+ON+K9J+2K2","website":"https://busseyainsworth.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Peterborough. Rated 5.0 from 106 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/bussey-ainsworth-lawyers-peterborough.png"}','{"1":[["08:00","17:30"]],"2":[["08:00","17:30"]],"3":[["08:00","17:30"]],"4":[["08:00","17:30"]],"5":[["08:00","15:00"]]}','Bussey Ainsworth Lawyers is a Peterborough firm serving the Kawarthas since 1988 in real estate, wills, estates, business and charity law.

The firm describes itself as small and local, and says it has closed property purchases and sales across the Kawarthas for four decades, including homes, cottages and farms. Barry Bussey has appeared before the Supreme Court of Canada, holds a doctorate in law from Leiden University and has written on constitutional rights and religious liberty. The firm also advises charities on incorporation, governance and the Ontario Not-for-Profit Corporations Act transition, and its lawyers act as notaries public and commissioners of oaths.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('houlihan-law-sarnia','Houlihan Law','Sarnia','ON','southwestern',0,5,89,43.0045838,-82.3887166,'{"name":"Houlihan Law","city":"Sarnia","featured":false,"tags":["Real Estate","Wills & Estates"],"caseTypes":["realestate","wills"],"region":"southwestern","province":"ON","lat":43.0045838,"lng":-82.3887166,"address":"640 Cathcart Blvd Unit 2, Sarnia, ON N7V 2N4","phone":"+15194912136","rating":5,"count":89,"slug":"houlihan-law-sarnia","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Houlihan+Law+Sarnia+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=640+Cathcart+Blvd+Unit+2%2C+Sarnia%2C+ON+N7V+2N4","website":"https://houlihanlaw.ca","blurb":"Real Estate / Wills & Estates in Sarnia. Rated 5.0 from 89 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/houlihan-law-sarnia.png"}',NULL,'Houlihan Law is a downtown Sarnia practice focused on real estate, mortgages, wills, powers of attorney and estate administration.

Spencer Houlihan was born and raised in Sarnia. He earned a law degree from Griffith University in 2014 after an honours degree in political science at Laurier, and was called to the Ontario bar in June 2017. His site also lists notary public services and says the office uses technology to save clients time. Outside the office he has been a long-standing member of the Sarnia Saints Rugby and Football Club, serving on its board and as president in 2021.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('norton-law-pc-oshawa','Norton Law PC','Oshawa','ON','york-durham',0,5,87,43.8970379,-78.8629025,'{"name":"Norton Law PC","city":"Oshawa","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"york-durham","province":"ON","lat":43.8970379,"lng":-78.8629025,"address":"21 Simcoe St S, Oshawa, ON L1H 4G1","phone":"+16476167667","rating":5,"count":87,"slug":"norton-law-pc-oshawa","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Norton+Law+PC+Oshawa+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=21+Simcoe+St+S%2C+Oshawa%2C+ON+L1H+4G1","website":"https://norton-law.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Oshawa. Rated 5.0 from 87 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/norton-law-pc-oshawa.png"}','{"1":[["00:00","23:59"]],"2":[["00:00","23:59"]],"3":[["00:00","23:59"]],"4":[["00:00","23:59"]],"5":[["00:00","23:59"]],"6":[["00:00","23:59"]],"7":[["00:00","23:59"]]}','Norton Law PC is an Oshawa criminal defence practice led by Steve Norton, representing people charged with offences across the Greater Toronto Area.

Steve Norton earned a Juris Doctor at Bond University while completing a master''s in business administration in Australia, where he also clerked at criminal and commercial litigation firms. He holds a B.A. with honours from York University and is in good standing with the Law Society of Ontario and the Criminal Lawyers Association. The site discusses bail hearings, police questioning, the presumption of innocence and the right to a bail hearing within 24 hours, with pages written for charges in Ajax and Richmond Hill.','dynamic','live',NULL);
