The firm describes itself as local lawyers serving all of Simcoe County, including Barrie, Innisfil, Orillia, Midland and Alliston, as well as Bradford, Newmarket and Collingwood. Its injury work covers motor vehicle accidents, slip and falls and long-term disability. On the employment side it lists wrongful termination and workplace sexual harassment. Family law pages cover divorce, child and spousal support, custody and access, and separation and parenting agreements. Nicole Meringolo and Melissa Ritter are featured on the site.','dynamic','live',NULL);
