The site describes the practice as the city''s law firm since 1974, serving Peterborough and Cottage Country from 254 Brock Street. Its real estate team handles closings, title transfers and mortgage details, while family lawyers deal with custody, support and separation agreements. Wills, powers of attorney, probate forms and estate matters are also listed. Ian Keay, Oliver S. Cooper and Jackson Wiltshire appear on the lawyers page, and Julie Kirkpatrick is named in connection with wills and powers of attorney. The firm also publishes blog posts for executors and beneficiaries.','dynamic','live',NULL);
