Its website title is framed around working, studying and immigrating to Canada, and its description mentions work permits, study visas and permanent residence applications. The practice is listed under immigration and operates from 930 Lorne Avenue in Brandon, Manitoba. The site offers little detail beyond this overview of the services it presents.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('collaborative-law-corporation-nanaimo','Collaborative Law Corporation','Nanaimo','BC','bc-island',0,4.7,24,49.1648853,-123.9405858,'{"name":"Collaborative Law Corporation","city":"Nanaimo","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law","Employment Law"],"caseTypes":["family","employment"],"region":"bc-island","province":"BC","lat":49.1648853,"lng":-123.9405858,"address":"348 Wesley St, Nanaimo, BC V9R 2T6","phone":"+12508241255","rating":4.7,"count":24,"slug":"collaborative-law-corporation-nanaimo","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Collaborative+Law+Corporation+Nanaimo+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=348+Wesley+St%2C+Nanaimo%2C+BC+V9R+2T6","website":"https://collaborativelegal.ca","blurb":"Family Law / Employment Law in Nanaimo. Rated 4.7 from 24 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/collaborative-law-corporation-nanaimo.png"}',NULL,'Collaborative Law Corporation is a Nanaimo family law and mediation firm offering collaborative negotiation, mediation, arbitration and litigation.

The firm says most family law issues can be settled collaboratively, saving cost, time and stress, and that it serves Nanaimo, Vancouver and clients online across British Columbia. Services include separation and cohabitation agreements, independent legal advice, a 1 Day Divorce program, desk order divorces and med-arb. It also hosts a family and business mediation and arbitration centre. Its team page names Nick Greer, Kevin Cantelon, Muadi Kalambay and Amanda Ferguson, and the office at 348 Wesley Street is downtown next to the Nanaimo courts.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('campisi-law-st-catharines-st-catharines','Campisi Law St. Catharines','St. Catharines','ON','hamilton-niagara',0,5,22,43.1599626,-79.2465686,'{"name":"Campisi Law St. Catharines","city":"St. Catharines","featured":false,"tags":["Personal Injury"],"caseTypes":["injury"],"region":"hamilton-niagara","province":"ON","lat":43.1599626,"lng":-79.2465686,"address":"110 James St #400, St. Catharines, ON L2R 7E8","phone":"+12899072476","rating":5,"count":22,"slug":"campisi-law-st-catharines-st-catharines","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Campisi+Law+St.+Catharines+St.+Catharines+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=110+James+St+%23400%2C+St.+Catharines%2C+ON+L2R+7E8","website":"https://campisilaw.ca","blurb":"Personal Injury in St. Catharines. Rated 5.0 from 22 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/campisi-law-st-catharines-st-catharines.webp"}','{"1":[["09:00","17:00"]],"2":[["09:00","17:00"]],"3":[["09:00","17:00"]],"4":[["09:00","17:00"]],"5":[["09:00","17:00"]]}','Campisi Law is an Ontario personal injury firm handling accident injury, disability and accident benefits cases for clients across the province.

This office is listed in St. Catharines at 110 James Street, Suite 400, while the firm''s site describes particular depth in the Greater Toronto Area and mentions Vaughan. It says support is available in more than 20 languages. Injury work is handled under a contingency fee agreement, meaning fees depend on a successful settlement or trial outcome, and the site refers to reports from physicians, accident reconstruction engineers and economists. Soft tissue injuries and rehabilitation planning are among the topics covered.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('henderson-family-law-thunder-bay','Henderson Family Law','Thunder Bay','ON','northern',0,4.9,21,48.4360337,-89.218462,'{"name":"Henderson Family Law","city":"Thunder Bay","featured":false,"tags":["Family Law"],"caseTypes":["family"],"region":"northern","province":"ON","lat":48.4360337,"lng":-89.218462,"address":"34 Cumberland St N, Thunder Bay, ON P7A 4L3","phone":"+18073442400","rating":4.9,"count":21,"slug":"henderson-family-law-thunder-bay","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Henderson+Family+Law+Thunder+Bay+Ontario","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=34+Cumberland+St+N%2C+Thunder+Bay%2C+ON+P7A+4L3","website":"https://www.hendersonfamilylaw.ca","blurb":"Family Law in Thunder Bay. Rated 4.9 from 21 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/henderson-family-law-thunder-bay.png"}',NULL,'Henderson Family Law is a Thunder Bay firm that works only on family law matters.

The firm says it is the only multi-lawyer firm in northwestern Ontario that focuses on family law, and describes a candid, compassionate and respectful approach in which clients are helped to understand what they need to know before making decisions. According to its FAQ, a trained law clerk asks a few confidential questions at first and helps match the client with a suitable lawyer. The office is in the James Whalen building at 34 Cumberland Street North, Suite 600, open weekdays from 8:30 am to 5 pm.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('fg-avocat-inc-repentigny','FG Avocat inc.','Repentigny','QC','qc-lanaudiere',0,5,20,45.7560085,-73.4453713,'{"name":"FG Avocat inc.","city":"Repentigny","featured":false,"tags":["Criminal Defence"],"caseTypes":["criminal"],"region":"qc-lanaudiere","province":"QC","lat":45.7560085,"lng":-73.4453713,"address":"121 Bd Industriel #218, Repentigny, Quebec J6A 7K4","phone":"+14388655297","rating":5,"count":20,"slug":"fg-avocat-inc-repentigny","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/FG+Avocat+inc.+Repentigny+Quebec","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=121+Bd+Industriel+%23218%2C+Repentigny%2C+Quebec+J6A+7K4","website":"https://www.fgavocat.ca","blurb":"Criminal Defence in Repentigny. Rated 5.0 from 20 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/fg-avocat-inc-repentigny.webp"}',NULL,'FG Avocat is a Repentigny firm practising criminal and penal law, from impaired driving and criminal offences to pardon applications and traffic tickets.

Its website introduces Me François Gaudreau and says the firm defends people charged in the Joliette, Repentigny and Laval areas, with service points listed in Joliette, Laval, Saint-Jérôme, Terrebonne, Trois-Rivières and Témiscamingue (Ville-Marie). It describes supporting clients from the first steps after an arrest for impaired driving through to court appearances, and it offers to help challenge a ticket considered unjustified. The site is in French.','dynamic','live',NULL);
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO firms (slug,name,city,province,region,featured,rating,review_count,lat,lng,data,hours,about,page_mode,status,created_by) VALUES ('fabris-mciver-and-durvin-nanaimo','Fabris McIver & Durvin','Nanaimo','BC','bc-island',0,4.6,21,49.162836,-123.9356367,'{"name":"Fabris McIver & Durvin","city":"Nanaimo","featured":false,"tags":["General Practice"],"caseTypes":[],"region":"bc-island","province":"BC","lat":49.162836,"lng":-123.9356367,"address":"40 Cavan St, Nanaimo, BC V9R 5M2","phone":"+12507536661","rating":4.6,"count":21,"slug":"fabris-mciver-and-durvin-nanaimo","mapsUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/Fabris+McIver+%26+Durvin+Nanaimo+British+Columbia","dirUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=40+Cavan+St%2C+Nanaimo%2C+BC+V9R+5M2","website":"https://www.fabris-law.com","blurb":"Law firm in Nanaimo. Rated 4.6 from 21 Google reviews.","type":"logo","src":"images/logos/fabris-mciver-and-durvin-nanaimo.png"}',NULL,'Fabris McIver & Durvin is a Nanaimo association of lawyers handling civil litigation, personal injury, employment, estates, real estate and business law.

The firm says it has looked after clients since 1980 and practises across British Columbia from 40 Cavan Street on Vancouver Island. Its clients include individuals, partnerships, corporations, insurers, financial institutions, retailers and contractors. The site says its lawyers tend to concentrate on preferred areas of practice and consult each other regularly. Iain D. McIver, called to the bar in 1990 after law studies at UBC, is described as working on personal injury, estate and inheritance disputes, commercial litigation and employment law.','dynamic','live',NULL);
